on for diagnosing and fixing scraping failures in the StakTrakr retail pipeline, utilizing a privacy-first approach.","zh":"零售提供商修复工具是一种用于诊断和修复StakTrakr零售管道中抓取失败问题的技术工具","ja":"Retail Provider Fixは、StakTrakrの小売パイプラインにおけるスクラピング失敗を診断して修復するための技術ツールです","ko":"零售 공급자 수정 도구는 StakTrakr의 소매 파이프라인에서 스크래핑 실패를 진단하고 수정하는 기술 도구입니다","es":"Retail-provider-fix es una herramienta de diagnóstico y solución de errores de scrap para la canalización de retail de StakTrakr","fr":"Retail-provider-fix est un outil de diagnostic et de correction des échecs de scraping pour le pipeline de vente au détail de StakTrakr","de":"Retail-provider-fix ist ein Tool zur Diagnose und Behebung von Scraping-Fehlern für die Einzelhandels-Pipeline von StakTrakr","pt":"O que é Retail Provider Fix? Uma ferramenta de diagnóstico e correção de falhas de scraping para dealers individuais","ru":"Что такое Retail Provider Fix? Инструмент для диагностики и исправления ошибок скрапинга для отдельных дилеров","ar":"ما هو Retail Provider Fix؟ أداة لتشخيص وأصلاح عيوب الحصاد للوكلاء الفرديين"},"features":{"en":["Runs Live Firecrawl Diagnostic via curl commands","Configures providers.json for customized dealer settings","Utilizes Fly.io container for seamless integration","Supports self-hosted Firecrawl at localhost:3002","Diagnoses scraping failures for individual dealers","Fixes issues in the StakTrakr retail pipeline"],"zh":["运行在Fly.io容器中","使用Firecrawl进行诊断","支持多个零售商配置","providers.json配置文件","CLI命令行工具","支持StakTrakr Api"],"ja":["Fly.ioコンテナ内で実行","Firecrawlを使用して診断","複数の小売業者構成をサポート","providers.json構成ファイル","CLIコマンドラインツール","StakTrakr Apiをサポート"],"ko":["Fly.io 컨테이너에서 실행","Firecrawl을 사용하여 진단","여러 소매 업체 구성 지원","providers.json 구성 파일","CLI 명령줄 도구","StakTrakr Api 지원"],"es":["Diagnóstico de errores de scrap en la canalización de retail de StakTrakr","Solución de problemas en el contenedor de Fly.io","Uso de Firecrawl para diagnosticar errores","Configuración de URL en providers.json","Ejecución dentro del contenedor de Fly.io"],"fr":[