gnóstico de errores de scrap","solución de problemas en Fly.io","Firecrawl","providers.json","canalización de retail de StakTrakr","herramientas de diagnóstico para scrap","solución de errores de scrap en retail"],"fr":["retail-provider-fix","diagnostic des échecs de scraping","résolution de problèmes dans Fly.io","Firecrawl","providers.json","pipeline de vente au détail de StakTrakr","outils de diagnostic pour scraping","correction des échecs de scraping en retail"],"de":["retail-provider-fix","Diagnose von Scraping-Fehlern","Fehlerbehebung in Fly.io","Firecrawl","providers.json","Einzelhandels-Pipeline von StakTrakr","Tools zur Diagnose von Scraping-Fehlern","Behebung von Scraping-Fehlern im Einzelhandel"],"pt":["retail provider fix","diagnóstico de falhas de scraping","correção de erros de scraping","staktrakr","fly.io","providers.json","ferramentas de ia","ia agente","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["retail provider fix","диагностика ошибок скрапинга","исправление ошибок скрапинга","staktrakr","fly.io","providers.json","ии агенты","инструменты ии","разработчики"],"ar":["retail provider fix","تشخيص عيوب الحصاد","أصلاح عيوب الحصاد","staktrakr","fly.io","providers.json","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مطورون"]}},"owner":"lbruton","repo":"StakTrakr","repoPath":"lbruton/StakTrakr","stars":2,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T11:50:11Z","topics":["gold","inventory","inventory-management-system","precious-metals","silver"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"retail-provider-fix","description":"Use when retail prices are failing for a vendor — wrong prices, fractional_weight warnings, all-zeros for a provider, page-loaded-no-price errors, or after suspecting a dealer changed their site structure. Covers live Firecrawl diagnostics, interpreting extraction failures, and updating price-extract.js and providers.json.","bodyPreview":"# Retail Provider Fix\n\nDiagnose and fix scraping failures for individual dealers in the StakTrakr retail pipeline.\nAll code lives in `StakTrakrApi/devops/fly-poller/`. All URL config is in `providers.json` on the `api` branch.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1 — Live Firecrawl Diagnostic\n\nRun directly inside the Fly.io container against the self-hosted Firecrawl at `localhost:3002`:\n\n```bash\n# Substitute URL from providers.json for the failing vendor/coin\nfly ssh console -a staktrakr -C \"curl -s -X POST http://lo","body":"# Retail Provider Fix\n\nDiagnose and fix scraping failures for individual dealers in the StakTrakr retail pipeline.\nAll code lives in `StakTrakrApi/devops/fly-poller/`. All URL config is in `providers.json` on the `api` branch.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1 — Live Firecrawl Diagnostic\n\nRun directly inside the Fly.io container against the self-hosted Firecrawl at `localhost:3002`:\n\n```bash\n# Substitute URL from providers.json for the failing vendor/coin\nfly ssh console -a staktrakr -C \"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3002/v1/scrape \\\n  -H ''Content-Type: application/json'' \\\n  -d ''{\\\"url\\\":\\\"PROVIDER_URL_HERE\\\",\\\"formats\\\":[\\\"markdown\\\"],\\\"waitFor\\\":6000,\\\"onlyMainContent\\\":false}'' \\\n  | python3 -c \\\"import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); \\\n    md=d.get(''data'',{}).get(''markdown'',''''); \\\n    w=d.get(''data'',{}).get(''warning'',''''); \\\n    print(''WARNING:'',w); print(''LEN:'',len(md)); print(md[:5000])\\\"\"\n```\n\nFor home poller, replace `fly ssh console -a staktrakr -C` with `ssh homepoller`:\n```bash\nssh homepoller \"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3002/v1/scrape ...\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 2 — Interpret the Output\n\n| Symptom | Meaning | Fix category |\n|---|---|---|\n| `warning: waitFor not supported` | Self-hosted Firecrawl ignores `waitFor` — JS never renders | Force Playwright path (see §4) |\n| Markdown contains only `\"Loading...\"` | Product table is JS-rendered, not in static HTML | Force Playwright path |\n| Redirected to homepage URL in metadata | Bot detection — page is blocked | Playwright + residential proxy (see §5) |\n| Spot prices appear before product price | `MARKDOWN_HEADER_SKIP_PATTERNS` not matching | Update header skip regex (see §3) |\n| `fractional_weight — 1/4 oz` | Scraper found a fractional nav price before product price | Update `MARKDOWN_CUTOFF_PATTERNS` or force Playwright |\n| `page loaded, no price` | Page renders but extraction regex doesn''t match | Update `extractPrice` logic for that provider |\n| `out_of_stock — PRE-ORDER` | Correct; item actually on pre-order | No fix needed unless provider is in `PREORDER_TOLERANT_PROVIDERS` |\n\n---\n\n## Step 3 — Config Map in `price-extract.js`\n\nAll extraction config is in `StakTrakrApi/devops/fly-poller/price-extract.js`.\n\n| Config | Line ~| What it does |\n|---|---|---|\n| `SLOW_PROVIDERS` | 474 | Adds `waitFor:6000` to Firecrawl AND `waitForTimeout(8000)` in Playwright fallback |\n| `MARKDOWN_HEADER_SKIP_PATTERNS` | 157 | Regex matching the site header/nav — cuts everything BEFORE the match |\n| `MARKDOWN_CUTOFF_PATTERNS` | 132 | Array of regexes — cuts everything AFTER the first match (removes related products, carousels) |\n| `PREORDER_TOLERANT_PROVIDERS` | 134 | Providers where \"Pre-Order\" text should NOT count as OOS |\n| `USES_AS_LOW_AS` | 117 | Providers that use \"As Low As\" as their primary price indicator (currently empty) |\n| `FBP_DEALER_NAME_MAP` | 196 | Maps FindBullionPrices dealer display names → provider IDs |\n| `onlyMainContent` | 485 | Firecrawl flag — set `false` for JMBullion to avoid missing the price table |\n\n**URL changes go in `providers.json` on the `api` branch** — NOT in price-extract.js.\nBoth pollers auto-sync providers.json before every run via `curl ... /api/data/retail/providers.json`.\n\n---\n\n## Step 4 — Self-Hosted Firecrawl `waitFor` Not Supported\n\n**This is the current state** (confirmed Feb 2026): The self-hosted Firecrawl container does not support the `waitFor` parameter. It returns the static/pre-render HTML immediately.\n\n**Consequence**: All JS-heavy SPAs (JMBullion, BullionExchanges, Monument Metals) get unrendered HTML from Firecrawl. Monument Metals and HeroBullion recover via the Playwright fallback. JMBullion does NOT recover because `fractional_weight` detection fires on the pre-render content and exits without triggering Playwright.\n\n**Fix options** (in order of preference):\n\n1. **Upgrade Firecrawl** to a version that supports `waitFor` — check `ghcr.io/firecrawl/firecrawl:latest` changelog\n2. **Force Playwright path for specific providers** — add them to a `PLAYWRIGHT_ONLY_PROVIDERS` set that skips Firecrawl entirely\n3. **Treat `fractional_weight` as Playwright trigger** — same as `price === null` in the fallback condition\n\n---\n\n## Step 5 — Bot Detection (BullionExchanges Pattern)\n\nWhen Firecrawl returns a redirect to the site''s homepage with only a banner image, bot detection is active.\n\n**Diagnosis**: `url` in response metadata differs from `sourceURL`. e.g., `sourceURL` = product page, `url` = `bullionexchanges.com`.\n\n**Current status**: BullionExchanges redirects ALL headless browser requests to homepage.\n\n**Fix options**:\n- Playwright with residential proxy chain (`HOME_PROXY_URL_2` → Webshare) — verify tinyproxy `ConnectPort` allows 443\n- Add browser stealth headers: real user-agent, `Accept-Language`, `Sec-Fetch-*` headers\n- If Tailscale exit node is active, ALL traffic routes via home residential IP — verify `tailscale status` in container before debugging further\n\n---\n\n## Step 6 — Test Single Vendor (Dry Run)\n\nFrom inside the container or home LXC:\n\n```bash\n# Fly.io — SSH in then run\nfly ssh console -a staktrakr\ncd /app\nDATA_DIR=/data/staktrakr-api-export/data \\\nFIRECRAWL_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3002 \\\nPLAYWRIGHT_LAUNCH=1 \\\nCOINS=ase PROVIDERS=jmbullion \\\nDRY_RUN=1 node price-extract.js\n\n# Filter to multiple vendors\nCOINS=ase,age PROVIDERS=jmbullion,bullionexchanges DRY_RUN=1 node price-extract.js\n```\n\nA successful result shows `✓ jmbullion: $XXX.XX (playwright)` or `✓ jmbullion: $XXX.XX (firecrawl)`.\n\n---\n\n## Step 7 — Deploy the Fix\n\nAfter verifying the fix in dry-run:\n\n```bash\n# Fly.io — redeploy container (required for price-extract.js changes)\ncd /Volumes/DATA/GitHub/StakTrakrApi/devops/fly-poller\nfly deploy -a staktrakr\n\n# Home LXC — no deploy needed; run-home.sh reads price-extract.js directly\n# Just commit + pull on the home server:\n# git pull origin main && (restart cron if needed)\n\n# providers.json URL changes — push to api branch\ngit checkout api\n# edit data/retail/providers.json\ngit add data/retail/providers.json && git commit -m \"fix(providers): update VENDOR urls\"\ngit push origin api\n# Both pollers pick this up automatically on next run (no redeploy needed)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Provider Failure Patterns\n\n### JMBullion — `fractional_weight`\n**Cause**: Firecrawl''s `waitFor` not supported → product table renders as \"Loading...\" → no price → but header skip exposes fractional nav links or spot prices that trigger false `fractional_weight` detection.\n**Fix**: Force Playwright path; verify `MARKDOWN_HEADER_SKIP_PATTERNS.jmbullion` still matches the header timestamp format.\n\n### BullionExchanges — `page loaded, no price`\n**Cause**: Bot detection redirects to homepage; Firecrawl gets one-line banner. Playwright fallback also redirected.\n**Fix**: Check tinyproxy HTTPS CONNECT config; use Playwright with stealth headers.\n\n### Monument Metals — `out_of_stock — PRE-ORDER`\n**Cause**: Coin legitimately on pre-order (common for new-year coins Jan–Mar).\n**Fix**: Update providers.json URL to a different in-stock coin, OR wait for inventory to arrive.\n\n### SDB — wrong price from \"Add on Items\" carousel\n**Cause**: `sdbullion` was in `USES_AS_LOW_AS`; carousel prices bled through.\n**Fix (applied 2026-02-20)**: `sdbullion` removed from `USES_AS_LOW_AS`; `MARKDOWN_CUTOFF_PATTERNS.sdbullion` added.\n\n---\n\n## Firecrawl Engine Capabilities (Self-Hosted)\n\nThe self-hosted container uses Firecrawl''s `basic` engine (not `playwright`). Capabilities:\n\n| Feature | Supported |\n|---|---|\n| Static HTML fetch | ✅ |\n| `waitFor` (JS wait) | ❌ (silently ignored, warning in response) |\n| `onlyMainContent` | ✅ |\n| `formats: markdown` | ✅ |\n| Proxy (`PROXY_SERVER`) | ✅ via playwright-service |\n| `BLOCK_MEDIA` | ✅ via playwright-service env |\n\nTo check current Firecrawl version in container:\n```bash\nfly ssh console -a staktrakr -C \"node -e \\\"const p=require(''/opt/firecrawl/package.json''); console.log(p.version)\\\"\"\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:06:56.266Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Debugging Agents needing to resolve scraping failures in retail pipelines.","zh":"适合需要解决零售管道中抓取失败的调试代理。","ja":"小売パイプラインでスクレイピングの失敗を解決する必要があるデバッグ エージェントに適しています。","ko":"소매 파이프라인에서 스크레이핑 실패를 해결해야 하는 디버깅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de depuración que necesitan resolver fallos de extracción en canalizaciones de retail.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de débogage qui ont besoin de résoudre les défaillances d''exploration dans les pipelines de détail.","de":"Perfekt für Debugging-Agents, die Scraping-Fehler in Retail-Pipelines beheben müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Depuração que precisam resolver falhas de scraping em pipelines de varejo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов отладки, которым необходимо решить проблемы сбоев скрапинга в розничных конвейерах.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تصحيح الأخطاء الذي يحتاج إلى حل مشاكل فشل الحصاد في خطوط أنابيب التجزئة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to diagnose and fix scraping failures for individual dealers using curl and JSON configurations from providers.json, enhancing the StakTrakr retail pipeline''s reliability and efficiency.","zh":"赋予代理诊断和修复使用curl和providers.json中的JSON配置为个别经销商提供的抓取失败，提高StakTrakr零售管道的可靠性和效率。","ja":"プロバイダ.jsonからのcurlとJSON構成を使用して、個々の販売業者向けのスクレイピングの失敗を診断して修復するエージェントを可能にし、StakTrakr小売パイプラインの信頼性と効率を向上させます。","ko":"providers.json에서 curl 및 JSON 구성으로 개별 딜러를 위한 스크레이핑 실패를 진단하고 수정할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 해주어 StakTrakr 소매 파이프라인의 신뢰성과 효율성을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diagnosticar y reparar fallos de extracción para concesionarios individuales utilizando configuraciones de curl y JSON desde providers.json, mejorando la confiabilidad y eficiencia de la canalización de retail de StakTrakr.","fr":"Permet aux agents de diagnostiquer et de corriger les défaillances d''exploration pour les concessionnaires individuels en utilisant les configurations curl et JSON à partir de providers.json, améliorant ainsi la fiabilité et l''efficacité du pipeline de détail StakTrakr.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Scraping-Fehler für einzelne Händler mithilfe von curl- und JSON-Konfigurationen aus providers.json zu diagnostizieren und zu beheben, wodurch die Zuverlässigkeit und Effizienz der StakTrakr-Einzelhandels-Pipeline verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a diagnosticar e corrigir falhas de scraping para concessionários individuais usando configurações curl e JSON do providers.json, melhorando a confiabilidade e eficiência do pipeline de varejo StakTrakr.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью диагностировать и исправлять сбои скрапинга для отдельных дилеров, используя конфигурации curl и JSON из providers.json, повышая надежность и эффективность розничного конвейера StakTrakr.","ar":"يمكن الوكيل من تشخيص وأصلاح مشاكل فشل الحصاد لفردی التجزئة باستخدام تكوينات curl و JSON من providers.json، مما يعزز موثوقية وكفاءة خط أنابيب التجزئة StakTrakr."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging scraping failures for precious metals portfolio trackers","Automating diagnostics for individual dealers in the StakTrakr pipeline","Fixing issues using live Firecrawl diagnostics"],"zh":["用于调试贵金属投资组合跟踪器的抓取失败","自动化StakTrakr管道中个别经销商的诊断","使用实时Firecrawl诊断修复问题"],"ja":["贵金属ポートフォリオトラッカーのスクレイピング失敗をデバッグするための","StakTrakrパイプラインの個々の販売業者向けの自動診断","ライブFirecrawl診断を使用して問題を修復する"],"ko":["貴금屬 投資組合 트래커의 스크레이핑 실패 디버깅을 위한","StakTrakr 파이프라인의 개별 딜러를 위한 자동화된 진단","실시간 Firecrawl 진단을 사용하여 문제를 수정"],"es":["Depuración de fallos de extracción para rastreadores de carteras de metales preciosos","Automatización de diagnósticos para concesionarios individuales en la canalización de StakTrakr","Corrección de problemas mediante diagnósticos en vivo de Firecrawl"],"fr":["Débogage des défaillances d''exploration pour les traceurs de portefeuille de métaux précieux","Automatisation des diagnostics pour les concessionnaires individuels dans le pipeline StakTrakr","Correction de problèmes à l''aide de diagnostics Firecrawl en direct"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei der Datenextraktion für Edelmetall-Portfoliotracker","Automatisierung der Diagnose für einzelne Händler in der StakTrakr-Pipeline","Behebung von Problemen mithilfe von Live-Diagnosen von Firecrawl"],"pt":["Depuração de falhas de scraping para rastreadores de carteira de metais preciosos","Automatização de diagnósticos para concessionários individuais no pipeline StakTrakr","Correção de problemas usando diagnósticos do Firecrawl ao vivo"],"ru":["Отладка сбоев скрапинга для трекеров портфеля драгоценных металлов","Автоматизация диагностических работ для отдельных дилеров в конвейере StakTrakr","Исправление проблем с использованием живых диагностических данных Firecrawl"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء فشل الحصاد لمتابعة محفظة المعادن النفيسة","تأهيل التشخيص التلقائي للوكلاء الفرديين في خط أنابيب StakTrakr","إصلاح المشاكل باستخدام تشخيص Firecrawl المباشر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the Fly.io container and self-hosted Firecrawl at localhost:3002","Limited to the StakTrakr retail pipeline and providers.json configuration"],"zh":["需要访问Fly.io容器和localhost:3002上的自托管Firecrawl","仅限于StakTrakr零售管道和providers.json配置"],"ja":["Fly.ioコンテナとlocalhost:3002上的セルフホストFirecrawlへのアクセスが必要","StakTrakr小売パイプラインとproviders.json構成のみに限定"],"ko":["Fly.io 컨테이너 및 localhost:3002의 자체 호스팅 Firecrawl에 대한 액세스가 필요","StakTrakr 소매 파이프라인 및 providers.json 구성에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al contenedor de Fly.io y Firecrawl autohospedado en localhost:3002","Limitado a la canalización de retail de StakTrakr y configuración de providers.json"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au conteneur Fly.io et à Firecrawl auto-hébergé sur localhost:3002","Limité au pipeline de détail StakTrakr et à la configuration providers.json"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf den Fly.io-Container und selbstgehosteten Firecrawl auf localhost:3002","Begrenzt auf die StakTrakr-Einzelhandels-Pipeline und die providers.json-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao contêiner Fly.io e ao Firecrawl auto-hospedado em localhost:3002","Limitado ao pipeline de varejo StakTrakr e configuração providers.json"],"ru":["Требует доступа к контейнеру Fly.io и самому хостингу Firecrawl на localhost:3002","Ограничен розничным конвейером StakTrakr и конфигурацией providers.json"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى حاوية Fly.io و Firecrawl المضيف ذاتيًا في localhost:3002","محدود بخط أنابيب التجزئة StakTrakr وتكوين providers.json"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4451ecad7e37dcdadc6a99f0333cf61d37edc71d5b928453a62bebe510febc51","qualityScore":42}');
