cture de test de .NET","Intégration avec des outils de testing tels que xUnit et coverlet"],"de":["Erstellung von Testprojekten mit xUnit","Konfiguration von Codeabdeckung mit coverlet","Konventionelle Verzeichnisstruktur (tests/ spiegelt src/)","Konfiguration des Test-SDKs und Projektverweises","Kompatibilität mit der Testinfrastruktur von .NET","Integration mit Testtools wie xUnit und coverlet"],"pt":["Criação de projetos de teste com xUnit","Configuração de cobertura de código com coverlet","Estrutura de diretórios convencional (tests/ espelhando src/)","Referência de projeto e configuração do SDK de teste"],"ru":["Создание тестовых проектов с xUnit","Настройка покрытия кода с coverlet","Конвенциональная структура директорий (tests/ отражающая src/)","Ссылка на проект и настройка тестового SDK"],"ar":["إنشاء مشاريع اختبار مع xUnit","ضبط تغطية التعليمات البرمجية مع coverlet","هيكل دليل عادي (tests/ يعكس src/)","مرجع المشروع وتفاصيل SDK الاختبار"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use dotnet-add-testing","dotnet-add-testing setup guide","dotnet-add-testing alternative","dotnet-add-testing vs nunit","dotnet-add-testing install","what is dotnet-add-testing","dotnet-add-testing xunit","dotnet-add-testing coverlet","dotnet test infrastructure"],"zh":["dotnet-add-testing","xUnit","coverlet",".NET 测试","AI 工具","测试基础设施","代码覆盖率","传统目录结构"],"ja":["dotnet-add-testing","xUnit","coverlet",".NET テスト","AI エージェント","テストインフラストラクチャ","コードカバレッジ","伝統的なディレクトリ構造"],"ko":["dotnet-add-testing","xUnit","coverlet",".NET 테스트","AI 에이전트","테스트 인프라","코드 커버리지","전통적인 디렉토리 구조"],"es":["dotnet-add-testing","pruebas unitarias","xUnit","coverlet","infraestructura de pruebas","proyectos .NET","testing de software","herramientas de testing","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["dotnet-add-testing","tests unitaires","xUnit","coverlet","infrastructure de test","projets .NET","testing de logiciel","outils de testing","développement de logiciel"],"de":["dotnet-add-testing","Einheitliche Tests","xUnit","coverlet","Testinfrastruktur",".NET-Projekte","Software-Testing","Testtools","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["dotnet-add-testing","infraestrutura de testes","xUnit","coverlet","cobertura de código","projetos de teste","SDK de teste","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de teste"],"ru":["dotnet-add-testing","инфраструктура тестирования","xUnit","coverlet","покрытие кода","тестовые проекты","тестовое SDK","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты тестирования"],"ar":["dotnet-add-testing","بنية اختبار","xUnit","coverlet","تغطية التعليمات البرمجية","مشاريع اختبار","SDK الاختبار","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الاختبار"]}},"owner":"rudironsoni","repo":"Synaxis","repoPath":"rudironsoni/Synaxis","stars":2,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T16:18:37Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dotnet-add-testing","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# dotnet-add-testing\n\nAdd test infrastructure scaffolding to an existing .NET project. Creates test projects with xUnit, configures code\ncoverage with coverlet, and sets up the conventional directory structure.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Test project creation with xUnit and coverlet\n- Conventional directory structure (tests/ mirroring src/)\n- Project reference wiring and test SDK configuration\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- In-depth testing patterns (xUnit v3, WebApplicationFactory, UI testing) -- see [skill:dotnet-test","body":"# dotnet-add-testing\n\nAdd test infrastructure scaffolding to an existing .NET project. Creates test projects with xUnit, configures code\ncoverage with coverlet, and sets up the conventional directory structure.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Test project creation with xUnit and coverlet\n- Conventional directory structure (tests/ mirroring src/)\n- Project reference wiring and test SDK configuration\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- In-depth testing patterns (xUnit v3, WebApplicationFactory, UI testing) -- see [skill:dotnet-testing-strategy]\n\n**Prerequisites:** Run [skill:dotnet-version-detection] first to determine SDK version and TFM. Run\n[skill:dotnet-project-analysis] to understand existing solution structure.\n\nCross-references: [skill:dotnet-project-structure] for overall solution layout conventions,\n[skill:dotnet-scaffold-project] which includes test scaffolding in new projects, [skill:dotnet-add-analyzers] for\ntest-specific analyzer suppressions.\n\n---\n\n## Test Project Structure\n\nFollow the convention of mirroring `src/` project names under `tests/`:\n\n````text\n\nMyApp/\n├── src/\n│   ├── MyApp.Core/\n│   ├── MyApp.Api/\n│   └── MyApp.Infrastructure/\n└── tests/\n    ├── MyApp.Core.UnitTests/\n    ├── MyApp.Api.UnitTests/\n    ├── MyApp.Api.IntegrationTests/\n    └── Directory.Build.props          # Test-specific build settings\n\n```xml\n\nNaming conventions:\n\n- `*.UnitTests` -- isolated tests with no external dependencies\n- `*.IntegrationTests` -- tests that use real infrastructure (database, HTTP, file system)\n- `*.FunctionalTests` -- end-to-end tests through the full application stack\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Create the Test Project\n\n```bash\n\n# Create xUnit test project\ndotnet new xunit -n MyApp.Core.UnitTests -o tests/MyApp.Core.UnitTests\n\n# Add to solution\ndotnet sln add tests/MyApp.Core.UnitTests/MyApp.Core.UnitTests.csproj\n\n# Add reference to the project under test\ndotnet add tests/MyApp.Core.UnitTests/MyApp.Core.UnitTests.csproj \\\n  reference src/MyApp.Core/MyApp.Core.csproj\n\n```csharp\n\n### Clean Up Generated Project\n\nRemove properties already defined in `Directory.Build.props`:\n\n```xml\n\n<!-- tests/MyApp.Core.UnitTests/MyApp.Core.UnitTests.csproj -->\n<Project Sdk=\"Microsoft.NET.Sdk\">\n  <ItemGroup>\n    <PackageReference Include=\"Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk\" />\n    <PackageReference Include=\"xunit.v3\" />\n    <PackageReference Include=\"xunit.runner.visualstudio\" />\n    <PackageReference Include=\"coverlet.collector\" />\n  </ItemGroup>\n  <ItemGroup>\n    <ProjectReference Include=\"..\\..\\src\\MyApp.Core\\MyApp.Core.csproj\" />\n  </ItemGroup>\n</Project>\n\n```csharp\n\nWith CPM, `Version` attributes are managed in `Directory.Packages.props`. Remove them from the generated `.csproj`.\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: Add Test-Specific Build Properties\n\nCreate `tests/Directory.Build.props` to customize settings for all test projects:\n\n```xml\n\n<!-- tests/Directory.Build.props -->\n<Project>\n  <Import Project=\"$([MSBuild]::GetPathOfFileAbove(''Directory.Build.props'', ''$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)../''))\" />\n  <PropertyGroup>\n    <IsPackable>false</IsPackable>\n    <IsTestProject>true</IsTestProject>\n    <!-- Use Microsoft.Testing.Platform v2 runner (requires Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk 17.13+/18.x) -->\n    <UseMicrosoftTestingPlatformRunner>true</UseMicrosoftTestingPlatformRunner>\n    <!-- Relax strictness for test projects -->\n    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>false</TreatWarningsAsErrors>\n  </PropertyGroup>\n</Project>\n\n```text\n\nThis imports the root `Directory.Build.props` (for shared settings like `Nullable`, `ImplicitUsings`, `LangVersion`) and\noverrides test-specific properties.\n\n---\n\n## Step 3: Register Test Packages in CPM\n\nAdd test package versions to `Directory.Packages.props`:\n\n```xml\n\n<!-- In Directory.Packages.props -->\n<ItemGroup>\n  <!-- Test packages -->\n  <PackageVersion Include=\"Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk\" Version=\"18.0.1\" />\n  <PackageVersion Include=\"xunit.v3\" Version=\"3.2.2\" />\n  <PackageVersion Include=\"xunit.runner.visualstudio\" Version=\"3.1.5\" />\n  <PackageVersion Include=\"coverlet.collector\" Version=\"8.0.0\" />\n</ItemGroup>\n\n```text\n\n### Optional: Mocking Library\n\nAdd a mocking library if the project needs test doubles:\n\n```xml\n\n<PackageVersion Include=\"NSubstitute\" Version=\"5.3.0\" />\n\n```xml\n\nOr for assertion libraries:\n\n```xml\n\n<PackageVersion Include=\"FluentAssertions\" Version=\"8.0.1\" />\n\n```xml\n\n---\n\n## Step 4: Configure Code Coverage\n\n### Coverlet (Collector Mode)\n\nThe `coverlet.collector` package integrates with `dotnet test` via the data collector. No additional configuration is\nneeded for basic coverage.\n\nGenerate coverage reports:\n\n```bash\n\n# Collect coverage (Cobertura format by default)\ndotnet test --collect:\"XPlat Code Coverage\"\n\n# Results appear in TestResults/*/coverage.cobertura.xml\n\n```xml\n\n### Coverage Thresholds\n\nFor CI enforcement, use `coverlet.msbuild` for threshold checks:\n\n```xml\n\n<!-- In test csproj or tests/Directory.Build.props -->\n<PackageReference Include=\"coverlet.msbuild\" />\n\n```xml\n\n```bash\n\n# Enforce minimum coverage threshold\ndotnet test /p:CollectCoverage=true \\\n  /p:CoverageOutputFormat=cobertura \\\n  /p:Threshold=80 \\\n  /p:ThresholdType=line\n\n```text\n\n### Coverage Report Generation\n\nUse `reportgenerator` for human-readable HTML reports:\n\n```bash\n\n# Install globally\ndotnet tool install -g dotnet-reportgenerator-globaltool\n\n# Generate HTML report\nreportgenerator \\\n  -reports:\"tests/**/coverage.cobertura.xml\" \\\n  -targetdir:coverage-report \\\n  -reporttypes:Html\n\n```xml\n\n---\n\n## Step 5: Add EditorConfig Overrides for Tests\n\nIn the root `.editorconfig`, add test-specific relaxations:\n\n```ini\n\n[tests/**.cs]\n# Allow underscores in test method names (Given_When_Then or Should_Behavior)\ndotnet_diagnostic.CA1707.severity = none\n\n# Test parameters are validated by the framework\ndotnet_diagnostic.CA1062.severity = none\n\n# ConfigureAwait not relevant in test context\ndotnet_diagnostic.CA2007.severity = none\n\n# Tests often have intentionally unused variables for assertions\ndotnet_diagnostic.IDE0059.severity = suggestion\n\n```text\n\n---\n\n## Step 6: Write a Starter Test\n\nReplace the template-generated `UnitTest1.cs` with a properly structured test:\n\n```csharp\n\nnamespace MyApp.Core.UnitTests;\n\npublic class SampleServiceTests\n{\n    [Fact]\n    public void Method_Condition_ExpectedResult()\n    {\n        // Arrange\n        var sut = new SampleService();\n\n        // Act\n        var result = sut.DoWork();\n\n        // Assert\n        Assert.NotNull(result);\n    }\n\n    [Theory]\n    [InlineData(1, 2, 3)]\n    [InlineData(0, 0, 0)]\n    [InlineData(-1, 1, 0)]\n    public void Add_TwoNumbers_ReturnsSum(int a, int b, int expected)\n    {\n        var result = Calculator.Add(a, b);\n        Assert.Equal(expected, result);\n    }\n}\n\n```text\n\n### Test Naming Convention\n\nUse the pattern `Method_Condition_ExpectedResult`:\n\n- `CreateUser_WithValidInput_ReturnsUser`\n- `GetById_WhenNotFound_ReturnsNull`\n- `Delete_WithoutPermission_ThrowsUnauthorized`\n\n---\n\n## Verify\n\nAfter adding test infrastructure, verify everything works:\n\n```bash\n\n# Restore (regenerate lock files if using CPM)\ndotnet restore\n\n# Build (verifies project references and analyzer config)\ndotnet build --no-restore\n\n# Run tests\ndotnet test --no-build\n\n# Run with coverage\ndotnet test --collect:\"XPlat Code Coverage\"\n\n```text\n\n---\n\n## Adding Integration Test Projects\n\nFor integration tests that need `WebApplicationFactory` or database access:\n\n```bash\n\ndotnet new xunit -n MyApp.Api.IntegrationTests -o tests/MyApp.Api.IntegrationTests\ndotnet sln add tests/MyApp.Api.IntegrationTests/MyApp.Api.IntegrationTests.csproj\ndotnet add tests/MyApp.Api.IntegrationTests/MyApp.Api.IntegrationTests.csproj \\\n  reference src/MyApp.Api/MyApp.Api.csproj\n\n```csharp\n\nAdd integration test packages to CPM (match the `Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.Testing` major version to the target framework\n-- e.g., `8.x` for `net8.0`, `9.x` for `net9.0`, `10.x` for `net10.0`):\n\n```xml\n\n<!-- Version must match the project''s target framework major version -->\n<PackageVersion Include=\"Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.Testing\" Version=\"10.0.0\" />\n<PackageVersion Include=\"Testcontainers\" Version=\"4.3.0\" />\n\n```xml\n\nIntegration test depth (WebApplicationFactory patterns, test containers, database fixtures) -- see\n[skill:dotnet-integration-testing].\n\n---\n\n## What''s Next\n\nThis skill covers test project scaffolding. For deeper testing guidance:\n\n- **xUnit v3 features and patterns** -- [skill:dotnet-xunit]\n- **Integration testing with WebApplicationFactory** -- [skill:dotnet-integration-testing]\n- **UI testing (Blazor, MAUI, Uno)** -- [skill:dotnet-blazor-testing], [skill:dotnet-maui-testing],\n  [skill:dotnet-uno-testing]\n- **Snapshot testing** -- [skill:dotnet-snapshot-testing]\n- **Test quality and coverage enforcement** -- [skill:dotnet-test-quality]\n- **CI test reporting** -- [skill:dotnet-add-ci] for starter, [skill:dotnet-gha-build-test] and\n  [skill:dotnet-ado-build-test] for advanced\n\n---\n\n\n\n## Code Navigation (Serena MCP)\n\n**Primary approach:** Use Serena symbol operations for efficient code navigation:\n\n1. **Find definitions**: `serena_find_symbol` instead of text search\n2. **Understand structure**: `serena_get_symbols_overview` for file organization\n3. **Track references**: `serena_find_referencing_symbols` for impact analysis\n4. **Precise edits**: `serena_replace_symbol_body` for clean modifications\n\n**When to use Serena vs traditional tools:**\n- ✅ **Use Serena**: Navigation, refactoring, dependency analysis, precise edits\n- ✅ **Use Read/Grep**: Reading full files, pattern matching, simple text operations\n- ✅ **Fallback**: If Serena unavailable, traditional tools work fine\n\n**Example workflow:**\n```text\n# Instead of:\nRead: src/Services/OrderService.cs\nGrep: \"public void ProcessOrder\"\n\n# Use:\nserena_find_symbol: \"OrderService/ProcessOrder\"\nserena_get_symbols_overview: \"src/Services/OrderService.cs\"\n```\n## References\n\n- [xUnit Documentation](https://xunit.net/)\n- [Coverlet](https://github.com/coverlet-coverage/coverlet)\n- [.NET Testing Best Practices](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/testing/unit-testing-best-practices)\n- [Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk)\n- [ReportGenerator](https://github.com/danielpalme/ReportGenerator)\n````\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:07:09.661Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for .NET Development Agents needing streamlined test infrastructure setup with xUnit and coverlet.","zh":"非常适合需要使用xUnit和coverlet简化测试基础设施设置的.NET开发代理。","ja":".NET開発エージェントがxUnitおよびcoverletを使用してテストインフラストラクチャの設定を簡素化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"xUnit과 coverlet를 사용하여 테스트 인프라 설정을 간소화해야 하는 .NET 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de .NET que necesitan una configuración de infraestructura de prueba simplificada con xUnit y coverlet.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement .NET nécessitant une configuration d''infrastructure de test simplifiée avec xUnit et coverlet.","de":"Perfekt für .NET-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine vereinfachte Testinfrastruktur-Setup mit xUnit und coverlet benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento .NET que precisam de uma infraestrutura de teste simplificada com xUnit e coverlet.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки .NET, которым необходима упрощенная настройка инфраструктуры тестирования с xUnit и coverlet.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تنمية .NET الذين يحتاجون إلى بنية اختبار مبسطة مع xUnit و coverlet."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create test projects with xUnit, configure code coverage with coverlet, and establish a conventional directory structure, thereby supercharging their .NET project development with efficient testing capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理创建使用xUnit的测试项目、使用coverlet配置代码覆盖率和建立传统的目录结构的能力，从而通过高效的测试能力超级充电他们的.NET项目开发。","ja":"エージェントがxUnitを使用したテストプロジェクトを作成し、coverletを使用してコードカバレッジを構成し、伝統的なディレクトリ構造を確立する能力を提供し、効率的なテスト機能で彼らの.NETプロジェクト開発を超充電します。","ko":"에이전트가 xUnit를 사용하여 테스트 프로젝트를 생성하고 coverlet를 사용하여 코드 커버리지 구성을 설정하고 전통적인 디렉토리 구조를 설정할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 효율적인 테스트 기능으로 .NET 프로젝트 개발을 초과 충전합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear proyectos de prueba con xUnit, configurar la cobertura de código con coverlet y establecer una estructura de directorios convencional, lo que supercarga su desarrollo de proyecto .NET con capacidades de prueba eficientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des projets de test avec xUnit, de configurer la couverture de code avec coverlet et d''établir une structure de répertoire conventionnelle, ce qui booste leur développement de projet .NET avec des capacités de test efficaces.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Testprojekte mit xUnit zu erstellen, Codeabdeckung mit coverlet zu konfigurieren und eine konventionelle Verzeichnisstruktur zu erstellen, wodurch ihre .NET-Projektentwicklung mit effizienten Testfunktionen aufgeladen wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar projetos de teste com xUnit, configurar a cobertura de código com coverlet e estabelecer uma estrutura de diretório convencional, supercarregando assim o desenvolvimento do projeto .NET com capacidades de teste eficientes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать тестовые проекты с xUnit, настраивать покрытие кода с coverlet и устанавливать конвенциональную структуру директорий, тем самым сверхзаряжая разработку проекта .NET эффективными возможностями тестирования.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بإنشاء مشاريع اختبار مع xUnit، وتكوين تغطية الكود مع coverlet، وإنشاء هيكل دليلي تقليدي، وبالتالي شحن تطوير مشروع .NET بقدرات اختبار فعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating test project creation for .NET applications","Configuring code coverage with coverlet for comprehensive testing","Setting up conventional directory structures for organized test management"],"zh":["为.NET应用程序自动创建测试项目","使用coverlet进行全面测试的代码覆盖率配置","设置传统的目录结构以进行有组织的测试管理"],"ja":[".NETアプリケーションのテストプロジェクトの自動作成","包括的なテストのためのcoverletを使用したコードカバレッジの構成","整理されたテスト管理のための伝統的なディレクトリ構造の設定"],"ko":[".NET 애플리케이션에 대한 테스트 프로젝트 자동 생성","포괄적인 테스트를 위한 coverlet를 사용한 코드 커버리지 구성","정리된 테스트 관리를 위한 전통적인 디렉토리 구조 설정"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de proyectos de prueba para aplicaciones .NET","Configuración de la cobertura de código con coverlet para pruebas exhaustivas","Configuración de estructuras de directorios convencionales para una gestión de pruebas organizada"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de projets de test pour les applications .NET","Configuration de la couverture de code avec coverlet pour des tests complets","Configuration de structures de répertoire conventionnelles pour une gestion de test organisée"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Testprojekten für .NET-Anwendungen","Konfiguration der Codeabdeckung mit coverlet für umfassende Tests","Einrichtung konventioneller Verzeichnisstrukturen für eine organisierte Testverwaltung"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de projetos de teste para aplicações .NET","Configurar a cobertura de código com coverlet para testes abrangentes","Configurar estruturas de diretório convencionais para gerenciamento de testes organizado"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание тестовых проектов для приложений .NET","Настроить покрытие кода с coverlet для всестороннего тестирования","Настроить конвенциональные структуры директорий для организованного управления тестами"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء مشاريع اختبار لتطبيقات .NET","تكوين تغطية الكود مع coverlet للاختبار الشامل","تكوين هياكل دليلية تقليديّة لإدارة الاختبار المنظّمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to .NET projects","Does not support in-depth testing patterns such as xUnit v3, WebApplicationFactory, or UI testing"],"zh":[".NET项目的限制","不支持诸如xUnit v3、WebApplicationFactory或UI测试等深入测试模式"],"ja":[".NETプロジェクトへの制限","xUnit v3、WebApplicationFactory、またはUIテストなどの包括的なテストパターンのサポートなし"],"ko":[".NET 프로젝트로의 제한","xUnit v3, WebApplicationFactory 또는 UI 테스트와 같은 심층 테스트 패턴 지원 안함"],"es":["Limitado a proyectos .NET","No admite patrones de prueba en profundidad como xUnit v3, WebApplicationFactory o pruebas de interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Limité aux projets .NET","N''a pas prise en charge des modèles de test en profondeur tels que xUnit v3, WebApplicationFactory ou des tests d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Begrenzt auf .NET-Projekte","Unterstützt keine tiefere Testmuster wie xUnit v3, WebApplicationFactory oder Benutzeroberflächentests"],"pt":["Limitado a projetos .NET","Não suporta padrões de teste em profundidade, como xUnit v3, WebApplicationFactory ou testes de UI"],"ru":["Ограничен проектами .NET","Не поддерживает глубокие паттерны тестирования, такие как xUnit v3, WebApplicationFactory или тестирование UI"],"ar":["محدود بمشاريع .NET","لا يدعم أنماط اختبار متقدمة مثل xUnit v3، WebApplicationFactory أو اختبار واجهة المستخدم"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"c7da38901614e7bab573431af1ebb11a38685a36be1e011cdac1750940344099","qualityScore":42}');
