 Principal-Arquiteto. Descubra como garantir uma migração suave e eficaz.","ru":"Узнайте, как перенести Sitecore XP с AWS на Azure с помощью плагина Claude Code и Principal-Architect. Откройте для себя, как обеспечить бесперебойную и эффе...","ar":"تعرف على كيفية نقل Sitecore XP من AWS إلى Azure باستخدام إضافة Claude Code و رئيس مهندس معماري. اكتشف كيف تضمن انتقالا سلسا وفعالا مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"definition":{"en":"Principal-architect is a Claude Code plugin that facilitates Sitecore XP infrastructure migrations, offering phased estimation, cross-reference analysis, and deliverable generation.","zh":"Principal Architect 是一种 AI 工具，用于 Sitecore XP 迁移","ja":"Principal Architect は AI エージェントであり、Sitecore XP の移行を支援します","ko":"Principal Architect는 Sitecore XP 마이그레이션을 지원하는 AI 도구입니다","es":"Principal Architect es un plugin de Claude Code que ayuda a los arquitectos a migrar de Sitecore XP en AWS a Azure","fr":"Principal Architect est un plugin de Claude Code qui aide les architectes à migrer de Sitecore XP sur AWS vers Azure","de":"Principal Architect ist ein Plugin von Claude Code, das Architekten bei der Migration von Sitecore XP von AWS zu Azure unterstützt","pt":"O que é Principal-Arquiteto? É um plugin do Claude Code que facilita a migração de Sitecore XP da AWS para a Azure.","ru":"Что такое Principal-Architect? Это плагин Claude Code, который облегчает миграцию Sitecore XP с AWS на Azure с помощью ИИ Агентов.","ar":"ما هو رئيس مهندس معماري? هو إضافة Claude Code التي تسهل نقل Sitecore XP من AWS إلى Azure باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"features":{"en":["Provides structured discovery for Sitecore XP on AWS to Azure migrations","Performs cross-reference analysis for accurate migration planning","Generates client-ready deliverables for streamlined communication","Enforces existing patterns for consistent architectural decisions","Decides where code belongs for optimal organization"],"zh":["结构化发现","交叉引用分析","阶段估算","客户准备就绪的交付物生成","Sitecore XP 到 Azure 基础设施的迁移"],"ja":["構造化された発見","クロスリファレンス分析","段階的な見積もり","クライアント用の納品物の生成","Sitecore XP から Azure インフラストラクチャへの移行"],"ko":["구조화된 발견","교차 참조 분석","단계적 예측","클라이언트 준비就绪의 交付物 생성","Sitecore XP에서 Azure 인프라로의 마이그레이션"],"es":["Análisis estructurado de la infraestructura de Sitecore XP","Generación de entregables para clientes","Estimación por fases de la migración","Análisis de referencia cruzada para la migración","Compatibilidad con Sitecore XP en AWS y Azure"],"fr":["Analyse structurée de l''infrastructure Sitecore XP","Génération de livrables pour les clients","Estimation par phases de la migration","Analyse de référence croisée pour la migration","Compatibilité avec Sitecore XP sur AWS et Azure"],"de":["Strukturierte Analyse der Sitecore XP-Infrastruktur","Generierung von Kundenlieferungen","Phasenweise Schätzung der Migration","Analyse der Kreuzreferenz für die Migration","Kompatibilität mit Sitecore XP auf AWS und Azure"],"pt":["Descoberta estruturada para migração de Sitecore XP","Análise de referência cruzada para garantir consistência","Geração de entregáveis prontos para o cliente","Suporte à migração de infraestrutura da AWS para a Azure","Integração com o plugin Claude Code"],"ru":["Структурированное обнаружение для миграции Sitecore XP","Анализ кросс-справки для обеспечения согласованности","Генерация клиентских доставок","Поддержка миграции инфраструктуры с AWS на Azure","Интеграция с плагином Claude Code и ИИ Агентами"],"ar":["اكتشاف منظم لنقل Sitecore XP","تحليل متقاطع لضمان الاتساق","توليد تقارير جاهزة للعميل","دعم نقل البنية التحتية من AWS إلى Azure","التكامل مع إضافة Claude Code وأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use principal-architect","principal-architect setup guide","sitecore xp migration tools","principal-architect vs sitecore migration alternatives","what is principal-architect","principal-architect install","sitecore xp on azure infrastructure","principal-architect for ai agents","sitecore xp migration best practices"],"zh":["AI 工具","Sitecore XP 迁移","Azure 基础设施","结构化发现","交叉引用分析","阶段估算","客户准备就绪的交付物生成"],"ja":["AI エージェント","Sitecore XP 移行","Azure インフラストラクチャ","構造化された発見","クロスリファレンス分析","段階的な見積もり","クライアント用の納品物の生成"],"ko":["AI 도구","Sitecore XP 마이그레이션","Azure 인프라","구조화된 발견","교차 참조 분석","단계적 예측","클라이언트 준비就绪의 交付物 생성"],"es":["migración de Sitecore XP","Principal Architect","Claude Code","Sitecore XP en AWS","Sitecore XP en Azure","análisis estructurado","generación de entregables","estimación por fases","análisis de referencia cruzada"],"fr":["migration de Sitecore XP","Principal Architect","Claude Code","Sitecore XP sur AWS","Sitecore XP sur Azure","analyse structurée","génération de livrables","estimation par phases","analyse de référence croisée"],"de":["Migration von Sitecore XP","Principal Architect","Claude Code","Sitecore XP auf AWS","Sitecore XP auf Azure","strukturierte Analyse","Generierung von Kundenlieferungen","phasenweise Schätzung","Analyse der Kreuzreferenz"],"pt":["migração de Sitecore XP","Principal-Arquiteto","Claude Code","AWS para Azure","migração de infraestrutura","descoberta estruturada","análise de referência cruzada","entregáveis prontos para o cliente"],"ru":["миграция Sitecore XP","Principal-Architect","Claude Code","AWS на Azure","миграция инфраструктуры","структурированное обнаружение","анализ кросс-справки","клиентские доставки","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["نقل Sitecore XP","رئيس مهندس معماري","Claude Code","AWS إلى Azure","نقل البنية التحتية","اكتشاف منظم","تحليل متقاطع","توليد تقارير جاهزة للعميل","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"twofoldtech-dakota","repo":"plugin-migration-planner","repoPath":"twofoldtech-dakota/plugin-migration-planner","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T00:30:32Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"principal-architect","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Principal Architect — MigrateIQ\n\nYou are the principal architect for MigrateIQ. You have deep knowledge of the codebase, its patterns,\nand the reasoning behind architectural decisions. Ensure every change is consistent, well-placed, and\naligned with the existing architecture.\n\n## Core Responsibilities\n\n1. **Decide where code belongs** — route vs component vs server util vs DB query vs MCP tool vs skill\n2. **Enforce existing patterns** — don''t invent new ones when a pattern already exists\n3. **","body":"# Principal Architect — MigrateIQ\n\nYou are the principal architect for MigrateIQ. You have deep knowledge of the codebase, its patterns,\nand the reasoning behind architectural decisions. Ensure every change is consistent, well-placed, and\naligned with the existing architecture.\n\n## Core Responsibilities\n\n1. **Decide where code belongs** — route vs component vs server util vs DB query vs MCP tool vs skill\n2. **Enforce existing patterns** — don''t invent new ones when a pattern already exists\n3. **Evaluate tradeoffs** — present options with pros/cons, recommend one, explain why\n4. **Review for correctness** — catch data flow bugs, server/client boundary violations, type gaps\n5. **Plan features** — break work into steps that follow the existing architecture\n6. **Guard consistency** — naming, file placement, styling, error handling, TypeScript strictness\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\npackages/db/          — Drizzle schema, queries, composition engine, seed scripts\napps/web/             — SvelteKit 5 frontend (Tailwind v4, TypeScript strict)\napps/mcp-server/      — MCP server (assessment/knowledge CRUD, exposes DB to Claude)\nskills/migrate-*/     — Claude Code plugin skills (discovery, analysis, estimate, etc.)\n```\n\n**Data ownership:** The DB (`packages/db/`) is the single source of truth. The MCP server exposes\nDB operations as tools. The web app reads from DB via server load functions and mutates via API routes.\nSkills operate via MCP tools, never importing from `packages/db` directly.\n\n## Decision Framework — Where Does Code Go?\n\n| Question | Answer |\n|----------|--------|\n| DB table or query? | `packages/db/src/schema.ts` or `packages/db/src/queries/` |\n| Reusable computation? | `apps/web/src/lib/utils/` |\n| Server-only logic? | `apps/web/src/lib/server/` |\n| Mutation endpoint? | `apps/web/src/routes/api/...+server.ts` |\n| Page data loading? | `+page.server.ts` in the relevant route |\n| Shared UI primitive? | `apps/web/src/lib/components/ui/` |\n| Feature component? | `apps/web/src/lib/components/` |\n| Route-specific UI? | Inline in `+page.svelte` |\n| Claude needs to call it? | MCP tool in `apps/mcp-server/` |\n| Multi-step Claude workflow? | Skill in `skills/` |\n\n## Architectural Principles\n\n### 1. Server-First, Client-Lean\n- All data fetching in `+page.server.ts` — never `fetch()` in `onMount`\n- Components receive data via `$props()`, derive with `$derived()`\n- Mutations go through `/api/` routes, then `invalidateAll()`\n- Client JS is for interactivity only (toggles, drawers, local UI state)\n\n### 2. Composition Over Configuration\n- Knowledge packs are atomic, composable units — one per platform/service\n- Composition engine merges packs at runtime from assessment stacks\n- Priority tiers resolve conflicts: infrastructure (10) > platform (20) > service (30)\n- Fallback cascade: DB composition > MCP direct > JSON files\n\n### 3. Explicit Types, Minimal Abstraction\n- `interface Props {}` for every component — no implicit prop spreading\n- Inline types for one-off shapes, shared types for reused structures\n- Don''t abstract until a pattern appears 3+ times\n- `any` acceptable at MCP/JSON boundaries; add runtime guards\n\n### 4. Atomic DB Operations\n- Multi-table writes use `db.transaction()`\n- Single-row: `result[0] ?? null`\n- Parallel reads: `Promise.all()`\n- Foreign keys cascade on delete\n\n### 5. Skill Boundaries\n- Skills invoke MCP tools — never import `packages/db`\n- Skills produce `.migration/` JSON as portable artifacts\n- Web app reads DB first, falls back to `.migration/`\n\n## Review Checklist\n\nWhen reviewing code or approaches:\n\n- [ ] **Placement** — Right file/layer per the decision framework?\n- [ ] **Pattern match** — Follows existing patterns? (read nearby files to confirm)\n- [ ] **Server/client boundary** — No DB imports in components, no `fetch` in server loads\n- [ ] **Naming** — PascalCase components, kebab-case utils/queries, SvelteKit conventions\n- [ ] **Types** — Props interface defined, no untyped public API\n- [ ] **Styling** — Design system tokens, no raw hex values (see [references/design-system.md](references/design-system.md))\n- [ ] **Data flow** — Mutations via API route > DB > `invalidateAll()` (see [references/data-flow.md](references/data-flow.md))\n- [ ] **Error handling** — Try/catch at boundaries, graceful fallbacks\n- [ ] **Transactions** — Multi-table writes wrapped in `db.transaction()`\n\n## Feature Planning Template\n\nWhen planning a new feature:\n\n1. **Data model** — Tables/columns needed? Modify `packages/db/src/schema.ts`\n2. **Queries** — Add to `packages/db/src/queries/`, export from index\n3. **MCP tools** — If Claude needs access, add in `apps/mcp-server/`\n4. **Server layer** — `+page.server.ts` loads, `/api/` routes for mutations\n5. **UI** — Components in `lib/components/`, pages in routes\n6. **Skills** — Update if the Claude workflow changes\n\nAlways read existing nearby code before writing new code. Match the patterns you find.\n\n## Detailed Reference\n\n- **[references/architecture.md](references/architecture.md)** — Monorepo structure, SvelteKit routes, component patterns, TypeScript conventions, naming rules\n- **[references/data-flow.md](references/data-flow.md)** — DB queries, server loads, API routes, MCP tools, reactive recomputation, composition engine\n- **[references/design-system.md](references/design-system.md)** — Neo-brutalist CSS, Tailwind v4 theme tokens, component styling, dark mode, accessibility\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:18:37.247Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Architect Agents needing structured Sitecore XP migration guidance on AWS to Azure infrastructure","zh":"非常适合需要在AWS到Azure基础设施上进行结构化Sitecore XP迁移指导的架构代理","ja":"AWSからAzureインフラストラクチャへの構造化Sitecore XP移行ガイダンスが必要なアーキテクトエージェントに最適","ko":"AWS에서 Azure 인프라로의 구조화된 Sitecore XP 마이그레이션 가이드가 필요한 아키텍트 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Arquitectura que necesitan orientación estructurada sobre la migración de Sitecore XP en AWS a infraestructura de Azure","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''architecture ayant besoin d''une orientation structurée pour la migration de Sitecore XP d''AWS vers une infrastructure Azure","de":"Perfekt für Architekturagenten, die eine strukturierte Anleitung für die Migration von Sitecore XP von AWS zu Azure-Infrastruktur benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Arquiteto que precisam de orientação estruturada para migração do Sitecore XP para infraestrutura da AWS para Azure","ru":"Идеально для Архитектурных Агентов, которым требуется структурированное руководство по миграции Sitecore XP с инфраструктуры AWS на Azure","ar":"مثالي لعميل الهيكل المطلوب الذي يحتاج إلى إرشادات هيكلية لتحويل Sitecore XP من البنية التحتية لشركة Amazon الالكترونية الى بنية تحتية Azure"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce existing architectural patterns and ensure consistent code placement across Sitecore XP on Azure, utilizing skills like MCP tool integration and DB query optimization, while maintaining alignment with the existing architecture","zh":"赋予代理执行现有的架构模式，并确保在Azure上的Sitecore XP中跨组件的一致代码放置，利用像MCP工具集成和DB查询优化这样的技能，同时保持与现有架构的一致","ja":"エージェントが既存のアーキテクチャパターンを実施し、Azure上的Sitecore XPでコンポーネント間の一貫したコード配置を確保することを可能にし、MCPツールの統合やDBクエリの最適化などのスキルを利用しながら、既存のアーキテクチャとの一貫性を維持","ko":"에이전트가 기존의 아키텍처 패턴을 시행하고, Azure上的 Sitecore XP에서 구성 요소 간의 일관된 코드 배치를 보장하며, MCP 툴 통합이나 DB 쿼리 최적화와 같은 스킬을 활용하여 기존 아키텍처와의 일관성을 유지","es":"Habilita a los agentes a hacer cumplir los patrones arquitectónicos existentes y garantizar una colocación de código consistente en Sitecore XP en Azure, utilizando habilidades como la integración de herramientas MCP y la optimización de consultas de base de datos, manteniendo al mismo tiempo la alineación con la arquitectura existente","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire respecter les modèles architecturaux existants et d''assurer un placement de code cohérent dans Sitecore XP sur Azure, en utilisant des compétences comme l''intégration d''outils MCP et l''optimisation des requêtes de base de données, tout en maintenant l''alignement avec l''architecture existante","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, bestehende Architekturmuster durchzusetzen und eine konsistente Codeplatzierung in Sitecore XP auf Azure sicherzustellen, indem Fähigkeiten wie die Integration von MCP-Tools und die Optimierung von Datenbankabfragen eingesetzt werden, während die Ausrichtung mit der bestehenden Architektur beibehalten wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor padrões arquiteturais existentes e garantir a colocação consistente de código em todo o Sitecore XP no Azure, utilizando habilidades como integração de ferramentas MCP e otimização de consultas de banco de dados, mantendo o alinhamento com a arquitetura existente","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить соблюдение существующих архитектурных шаблонов и гарантировать последовательное размещение кода по всему Sitecore XP на Azure, используя навыки, такие как интеграция инструмента MCP и оптимизация запросов базы данных, сохраняя при этом соответствие существующей архитектуре","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إرغام العميل على اتباع الأنماط المعمارية الحالية وضمان وضع الكود الثابت في جميع أنحاء Sitecore XP على Azure، باستخدام مهارات مثل دمج أداة MCP وتحسين استعلامات قاعدة البيانات، مع الحفاظ على الانسجام مع البنية التحتية الحالية"},"useCases":{"en":["Routing code changes to appropriate components","Enforcing consistent architectural patterns across Sitecore XP","Migrating Sitecore XP from AWS to Azure infrastructure"],"zh":["将代码更改路由到适当的组件","强制在Sitecore XP中执行一致的架构模式","将Sitecore XP从AWS迁移到Azure基础设施"],"ja":["コードの変更を適切なコンポーネントにルーティングする","Sitecore XPで一貫したアーキテクチャパターンを実施","Sitecore XPをAWSからAzureインフラストラクチャに移行"],"ko":["코드 변경을 적절한 구성 요소로 라우팅","Sitecore XP에서 일관된 아키텍처 패턴을 시행","Sitecore XP를 AWS에서 Azure 인프라로 마이그레이션"],"es":["Enrutamiento de cambios de código a componentes adecuados","Hacer cumplir patrones arquitectónicos coherentes en Sitecore XP","Migración de Sitecore XP desde la infraestructura de AWS a Azure"],"fr":["Acheminement des modifications de code vers les composants appropriés","Application de modèles architecturaux cohérents dans Sitecore XP","Migration de Sitecore XP de l''infrastructure AWS vers Azure"],"de":["Weiterleitung von Codeänderungen an geeignete Komponenten","Durchsetzung konsistenter Architekturmuster in Sitecore XP","Migration von Sitecore XP von der AWS- zur Azure-Infrastruktur"],"pt":["Encaminhar alterações de código para componentes apropriados","Impor padrões arquiteturais consistentes em todo o Sitecore XP","Migrar Sitecore XP da infraestrutura da AWS para a infraestrutura do Azure"],"ru":["Направление изменений кода в соответствующие компоненты","Обеспечение последовательных архитектурных шаблонов по всему Sitecore XP","Миграция Sitecore XP с инфраструктуры AWS на инфраструктуру Azure"],"ar":["إرسال تعديلات الكود إلى المكونات المناسبة","فرض الأنماط المعمارية الثابتة في جميع أنحاء Sitecore XP","نقل Sitecore XP من بنية تحتية Amazon الى بنية تحتية Azure"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires deep knowledge of Sitecore XP codebase and architecture","Limited to Sitecore XP on Azure migrations"],"zh":["需要对Sitecore XP代码库和架构有深入的了解","仅限于Sitecore XP在Azure上的迁移"],"ja":["Sitecore XPのコードベースとアーキテクチャについて深い理解が必要","Sitecore XP on Azureの移行のみに限定"],"ko":["Sitecore XP 코드베이스와 아키텍처에 대한 깊은 이해가 필요","Sitecore XP on Azure의 마이그레이션에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere un conocimiento profundo de la base de código y la arquitectura de Sitecore XP","Limitado a migraciones de Sitecore XP en Azure"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance approfondie de la base de code et de l''architecture de Sitecore XP","Limité aux migrations de Sitecore XP sur Azure"],"de":["Erfordert ein tiefes Verständnis der Codebasis und Architektur von Sitecore XP","Begrenzt auf Migrationen von Sitecore XP auf Azure"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento profundo da base de código e arquitetura do Sitecore XP","Limitado a migrações do Sitecore XP para o Azure"],"ru":["Требует глубокого знания кодовой базы и архитектуры Sitecore XP","Ограничен миграциями Sitecore XP на Azure"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة عميقة بقاعدة الكود وهيكلة Sitecore XP","محدود بنقل Sitecore XP الى Azure"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"fd3294864fadcccc0f1770c3d5a5b7b535a0fc956d4dc83fa4653f3740139b7a","qualityScore":42}');
