INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('lvzzzx/pointline/pointline-researcher', 'pointline-researcher', 'lvzzzx', 'pointline', 'community', 'pointline-researcher lvzzzx pointline community The pointline-researcher skill provides a PIT-accurate offline data lake for quant research, utilizing Polars and Delta Lake. It benefits developers and researchers seeking deterministic replay and idempotent ingestion. Pointline Researcher 是一个用于量化研究的 PIT 准确的离线数据湖，支持 Polars 和 Delta Lake。它提供了确定性的重放、幂等的摄取和线性可追溯性 Pointline Researcher は量化研究用の PIT 正確なオフラインデータレイクで、Polars と Delta Lake をサポートしています。決定的なリプレイ、イデンプテントなインジェスト、線形の追跡可能性を提供します Pointline Researcher는量화 연구용 PIT 정확한 오프라인 데이터 레이크입니다. 폴라스와 델타 레이크를 지원하며, 결정적인 재생,幂等한摄取 및 선형 추적 가능성을 제공합니다 pointline-researcher es una API de investigación para un lago de datos offline con precisión PIT, que utiliza Polars y Delta Lake para la investigación cuantitativa pointline-researcher est une API de recherche pour un lac de données hors ligne avec précision PIT, qui utilise Polars et Delta Lake pour la recherche quantique pointline-researcher ist eine Forschungs-API für einen Offline-Datensee mit PIT-Genauigkeit, die Polars und Delta Lake für die quantitative Forschung verwendet O Pointline Researcher é uma ferramenta de pesquisa de dados que oferece uma solução de lago de dados offline precisa para pesquisa quantitativa Pointline Researcher - это инструмент для исследования данных, предлагающий точное решение лагуны данных для количественных исследований Pointline Researcher هو أداة بحث بيانات تقدم حلًا دقيقًا للبحث الكمّي how to use pointline-researcher pointline-researcher alternative pointline-researcher setup guide PIT-accurate data lake Polars data processing Delta Lake data storage quant research API deterministic replay idempotent ingestion Pointline Researcher PIT 准确的离线数据湖 量化研究 Polars Delta Lake 单机数据湖 AIエージェント 数据湖构建 Utilizes Polars for efficient data processing Integrates with Delta Lake for reliable data storage Ensures PIT correctness and deterministic replay Provides idempotent ingestion and lineage traceability via file_id and file_seq Supports loading events, discovering symbols, and loading symbol meta data Builds a ClockSpineConfig for aligning data to a spine pointline-researcher is a Python-based research API for building a single-machine data lake, ensuring PIT correctness and lineage traceability via file_id and file_seq.');
