 de configuration d''oracle pour Matrix rain sous Win...","de":"Konfigurationsleitfaden für oracle mit Matrix rain unter ...","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Oracle para Matrix Rain no Window...","ru":"ИИ Агент Oracle: Руководство по Настройке для Matrix Rain...","ar":"دليل إعداد Oracle ل Matrix Rain في Terminal Windows"},"description":{"en":"Unlock the power of Matrix rain in Windows Terminal with Oracle. Learn how to process pending FAQ questions and automate answers with this AI agent skill.","zh":"了解Oracle AI工具如何自动处理MatrixShader支持页的FAQ，包括读取代码库和分类问题","ja":"Oracle AIエージェントがMatrixShaderサポートページのFAQを自動処理する方法について学びます","ko":"Oracle AI 에이전트가 MatrixShader 지원 페이지의 FAQ를 자동으로 처리하는 방법에 대해 알아보세요","es":"Aprende a utilizar oracle para procesar preguntas pendientes y mejorar la experiencia del usuario en Matrix rain para Windows Terminal","fr":"Découvrez comment utiliser oracle pour traiter les questions en attente et améliorer l''expérience utilisateur dans Matrix rain sous Windows Terminal","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie oracle verwenden, um ausstehende Fragen zu bearbeiten und die Benutzererfahrung in Matrix rain unter Windows Terminal zu verbessern","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o Oracle para processar perguntas pendentes e melhorar a experiência do usuário no Windows Terminal com Matrix Rain","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить ИИ Агент Oracle для обработки_pending вопросов и улучшения пользовательского опыта в Windows Terminal с Matrix Rain","ar":"تعرف على كيفية إعداد Oracle لمعالجة الأسئلة المعلقة وتحسين تجربة المستخدم في Terminal Windows مع Matrix Rain"},"definition":{"en":"Oracle is a Matrix rain AI agent skill for Windows Terminal that automates FAQ question processing and answering.","zh":"Oracle AI工具是一种自动处理MatrixShader支持页FAQ的工具","ja":"Oracle AIエージェントは、MatrixShaderサポートページのFAQを自動処理するAIツールです","ko":"Oracle AI 에이전트는 MatrixShader 지원 페이지의 FAQ를 자동으로 처리하는 AI 도구입니다","es":"Oracle es un agente de inteligencia artificial que procesa preguntas pendientes y proporciona respuestas","fr":"Oracle est un agent d''intelligence artificielle qui traite les questions en attente et fournit des réponses","de":"Oracle ist ein KI-Agent, der ausstehende Fragen bearbeitet und Antworten liefert","pt":"O que é Oracle? Um agente de inteligência artificial que processa perguntas pendentes e fornece respostas precisas","ru":"Что такое ИИ Агент Oracle? Это агент, который обрабатывает_pending вопросы и предоставляет точные ответы","ar":"ما هو Oracle؟ وسيط ذكاء اصطناعي يقوم بمعالجة الأسئلة المعلقة ويوفر إجابات دقيقة"},"features":{"en":["Fetches pending questions via GET /api/faq?status=pending with Bearer auth","Reads codebase files to build answer context","Classifies questions into CAN ANSWER, NEEDS HUMAN, or SPAM categories","Requires user approval before executing each action","Supports drafting accurate answers using the codebase","Identifies spam for cleanup"],"zh":["自动处理MatrixShader支持页的FAQ","读取代码库以构建答案上下文","分类问题为可以回答、需要人工回答和垃圾邮件","需要用户批准才能执行任何操作","使用GET /api/faq?status=pending API获取待处理问题"],"ja":["MatrixShaderサポートページのFAQを自動処理","コードベースを読み込んで回答のコンテキストを構築","質問を回答可能、人間による回答が必要、スパムに分類","ユーザーの承認が必要なので、どのアクションも実行されません","GET /api/faq?status=pending APIを使用して未処理の質問を取得"],"ko":["MatrixShader 지원 페이지의 FAQ를 자동으로 처리","코드베이스를 읽어 답변의 컨텍스트를 구축","질문을 답변 가능, 인간의 답변 필요, 스팸으로 분류","사용자의 승인이 필요하므로 어떤 동작도 실행되지 않습니다","GET /api/faq?status=pending API를 사용하여 미처리된 질문을 가져옵니다"],"es":["Procesamiento de preguntas pendientes mediante API de MatrixShader","Lectura de archivos de código para construir contexto de respuestas","Clasificación de preguntas en categorías de respuesta","Autenticación mediante Bearer para asegurar la seguridad","Compatibilidad con Windows Terminal para una experiencia de usuario integrada"],"fr":["Traitement des questions en attente via l''API MatrixShader","Lecture de fichiers de code pour construire le contexte des réponses","Classification des questions en catégories de réponse","Authentification par Bearer pour assurer la sécurité","Compatibilité avec Windows Terminal pour une expérience utilisateur intégrée"],"de":["Verarbeitung von ausstehenden Fragen über die MatrixShader-API","Lesevorgang von Code-Dateien, um Antwortkontext zu erstellen","Klassifizierung von Fragen in Antwortkategorien","Authentifizierung mittels Bearer für die Sicherheit","Kompatibilität mit Windows Terminal für eine integrierte Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Processa perguntas pendentes via API","Lê arquivos de código para construir contexto de respostas","Classifica perguntas em categorias de resposta","Requer aprovação do usuário antes de executar ações","Integração com Matrix Rain no Windows Terminal"],"ru":["Обрабатывает_pending вопросы через API","Читает файлы кода для построения контекста ответов","Классифицирует вопросы по категориям ответов","Требует одобрения пользователя перед выполнением действий","Интеграция с Matrix Rain в Windows Terminal"],"ar":["معالجة الأسئلة المعلقة عبر واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","قراءة ملفات الشفرة لبناء سياق الإجابات","تصنيف الأسئلة في فئات الإجابة","تطلب موافقة المستخدم قبل تنفيذ الإجراءات","التكامل مع Matrix Rain في Terminal Windows"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use oracle","what is oracle","oracle alternative","oracle vs matrixshader","oracle install","oracle setup guide","matrix rain windows terminal","ai agent skills for windows terminal","automating faq questions"],"zh":["Oracle AI工具","MatrixShader支持页FAQ","自动处理FAQ","代码库读取","问题分类","AI工具开发","FAQ自动回答"],"ja":["Oracle AIエージェント","MatrixShaderサポートページFAQ","FAQ自動処理","コードベース読み込み","質問分類","AIツール開発","FAQ自動回答"],"ko":["Oracle AI 에이전트","MatrixShader 지원 페이지 FAQ","FAQ 자동 처리","코드베이스 읽기","질문 분류","AI 도구 개발","FAQ 자동 답변"],"es":["oracle","Matrix rain","Windows Terminal","agente de inteligencia artificial","procesamiento de preguntas","API de MatrixShader","autenticación Bearer","desarrollo de herramientas de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["oracle","Matrix rain","Windows Terminal","agent d''intelligence artificielle","traitement des questions","API MatrixShader","authentification Bearer","développement d''outils d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["oracle","Matrix rain","Windows Terminal","KI-Agent","Verarbeitung von Fragen","MatrixShader-API","Bearer-Authentifizierung","Entwicklung von KI-Tools"],"pt":["Oracle AI","Matrix Rain","Windows Terminal","processamento de perguntas","inteligência artificial","API","contexto de respostas","classificação de perguntas"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Oracle","Matrix Rain","Windows Terminal","обработка_pending вопросов","искусственный интеллект","API","контекст ответов","классификация вопросов"],"ar":["Oracle الذكي","Matrix Rain","Terminal Windows","معالجة الأسئلة المعلقة","الذكاء الاصطناعي","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","سياق الإجابات","تصنيف الأسئلة"]}},"owner":"matrixshader","repo":"matrix-shader","repoPath":"matrixshader/matrix-shader","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T00:11:52Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"oracle","description":"Process pending FAQ questions — drafts answers from codebase knowledge, flags unknowns for human review, and publishes approved answers. Use when the user says /oracle or asks to process the FAQ inbox.","bodyPreview":"<objective>\nProcess all pending FAQ questions submitted via the MatrixShader support page. Reads the codebase to draft accurate answers for questions Claude can handle, flags business/roadmap questions for the human, and identifies spam for cleanup. Every action requires user approval before executing.\n</objective>\n\n<quick_start>\n1. Fetch pending questions: `GET /api/faq?status=pending` with Bearer auth\n2. Read codebase files to build answer context\n3. Classify each question into CAN ANSWER, NEE","body":"<objective>\nProcess all pending FAQ questions submitted via the MatrixShader support page. Reads the codebase to draft accurate answers for questions Claude can handle, flags business/roadmap questions for the human, and identifies spam for cleanup. Every action requires user approval before executing.\n</objective>\n\n<quick_start>\n1. Fetch pending questions: `GET /api/faq?status=pending` with Bearer auth\n2. Read codebase files to build answer context\n3. Classify each question into CAN ANSWER, NEEDS HUMAN, or JUNK\n4. Present all results grouped by bucket with draft answers\n5. User approves/edits/skips each — then execute API calls\n</quick_start>\n\n<essential_principles>\n- **Never fabricate answers.** Only answer from codebase knowledge, README, and docs. If unsure, classify as NEEDS HUMAN.\n- **Never publish without approval.** Always show the draft and wait for the user to confirm.\n- **Keep answers concise.** 1-3 sentences. Helpful and direct, matching the Matrix operator voice (but not over-the-top).\n- **Batch efficiently.** Show all CAN ANSWER questions together so the user can approve in bulk or review individually.\n</essential_principles>\n\n<context>\n**API base:** `https://matrixshader.com/api/faq`\n\n**Auth:** `Authorization: Bearer $DASHBOARD_PASSWORD` header (env var). If not set, ask the user for it.\n\n**Endpoints:**\n- `GET /api/faq?status=pending` — fetch pending questions (auth required)\n- `PATCH /api/faq` — update a question (auth required). Body: `{ \"id\", \"action\", ... }`\n  - `action: \"publish\"` — requires `answer` field, optional `category`\n  - `action: \"dismiss\"` — marks as dismissed\n  - `action: \"reopen\"` — returns to pending\n  - `action: \"update\"` — partial update (answer, category, tags)\n- `DELETE /api/faq?id=xxx` — permanently delete (auth required)\n\n**Valid categories:** `general`, `installation`, `usage`, `licensing`, `compatibility`, `troubleshooting`\n</context>\n\n<process>\n**Step 1: Authenticate and fetch**\n\nRun `scripts/fetch-pending.sh` to get all pending questions. If DASHBOARD_PASSWORD is not in environment, ask the user for it.\n\nIf zero pending questions, say \"The Oracle sees no unanswered questions.\" and stop.\n\n**Step 2: Display summary**\n\nShow a numbered overview:\n```\nThe Oracle: {N} pending questions\n\n#1 [{category}] \"{question}\" — {email} ({date})\n#2 [{category}] \"{question}\" — {email} ({date})\n...\n```\n\n**Step 3: Build answer context**\n\nRead these codebase files to prepare for drafting answers:\n- `CLAUDE.md` — architecture overview, key mechanisms\n- `README.md` — user-facing feature list, install instructions\n- `Website/index.html` — product page feature descriptions\n- `Website/redpill/index.html` — Red Pill purchase page details\n- `matrix_control.ps1` — control panel features and hotkeys\n- `matrix_setup.ps1` — setup wizard flow\n- `Website/privacy/index.html` and `Website/terms/index.html` — policy questions\n\nSearch additional files as needed for specific questions (shader files, C# source, etc.).\n\n**Step 4: Classify each question**\n\nFor each pending question:\n1. Check if the category is correct — note any corrections needed\n2. Determine which bucket it belongs in:\n\n| Bucket | Criteria | Examples |\n|--------|----------|---------|\n| **CAN ANSWER** | Answerable from codebase/docs | \"How do I change colors?\", \"Does it work on Windows 10?\" |\n| **NEEDS HUMAN** | Requires business judgment, account info, or roadmap commitment | \"Can I get a discount?\", \"When will you support macOS?\", \"I want a refund\" |\n| **JUNK** | Gibberish, test data, spam, not a real question | \"asdfasdf\", \"test123\" |\n\n**Step 5: Present results**\n\nGroup by bucket and show:\n\nFor **CAN ANSWER** — show question, category correction (if any), and draft answer\nFor **NEEDS HUMAN** — show question and explain why only the human can answer it\nFor **JUNK** — show question and recommend dismiss or delete\n\nAsk the user how to proceed. Accept bulk commands (\"publish all\", \"looks good\") or individual review.\n\n**Step 6: Execute approved actions**\n\nFor each approved action, run the appropriate API call using `scripts/faq-action.sh`:\n\n- **Publish**: `scripts/faq-action.sh publish <id> \"<answer>\" [category]`\n- **Dismiss**: `scripts/faq-action.sh dismiss <id>`\n- **Delete**: `scripts/faq-action.sh delete <id>`\n- **Update category**: `scripts/faq-action.sh update <id> [category]`\n\n**Step 7: Summary**\n\nShow final tally:\n```\nOracle Complete:\n  Published: {N}\n  Dismissed: {N}\n  Deleted:   {N}\n  Skipped:   {N} (still pending)\n```\n</process>\n\n<anti_patterns>\n- **Guessing answers** — If you''re not confident from codebase sources, mark NEEDS HUMAN. Wrong answers on a public FAQ are worse than no answer.\n- **Publishing without approval** — Every publish must be explicitly confirmed by the user.\n- **Over-theming answers** — Answers should be helpful and clear. Don''t force Matrix references into every response.\n- **Skipping category correction** — If a question is miscategorized, fix it as part of the publish/update call.\n</anti_patterns>\n\n<success_criteria>\nTriage is complete when:\n- All pending questions have been classified into buckets\n- User has reviewed and decided on each question (publish, dismiss, delete, or skip)\n- All approved API calls have been executed successfully\n- Final summary shows the tally of actions taken\n</success_criteria>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:44:18.606Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude and AutoGPT requiring advanced FAQ analysis and codebase reading capabilities.","zh":"适合于像 Claude 和 AutoGPT 这样的 AI 代理，需要高级的 FAQ 分析和代码库阅读能力。","ja":"Claude や AutoGPT などの高度な FAQ 分析とコードベースの読み取り機能を必要とする AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"클라우드 및 오토지피티와 같은 고급 FAQ 분석 및 코드베이스 읽기 기능을 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude y AutoGPT que requieren un análisis de preguntas frecuentes avanzado y capacidades de lectura de código base.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA comme Claude et AutoGPT nécessitant une analyse de questions fréquentes avancée et des capacités de lecture de codebase.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude und AutoGPT, die eine erweiterte FAQ-Analyse und Codebase-Lese-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude e AutoGPT que requerem análise de FAQ avançada e capacidades de leitura de código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude и AutoGPT, требующих продвинутого анализа FAQ и возможностей чтения кода.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكلاء الذكية مثل Claude و AutoGPT التي تتطلب تحليل FAQ متقدم وقدرات قراءة الشفرة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to draft accurate answers by reading codebase files, classify questions into actionable categories, and identify spam using protocols like Bearer auth and APIs such as GET /api/faq, thereby streamlining support page management.","zh":"通过读取代码库文件，根据协议（如 Bearer 身份验证）和 API（如 GET /api/faq）将问题分类为可执行的类别，并识别垃圾信息，从而简化支持页面管理，赋予代理生成准确答案的能力。","ja":"コードベースファイルを読み取って、Bearer 認証などのプロトコルや GET /api/faq などの API を使用して、質問を実行可能なカテゴリに分類し、スパムを識別することで、サポートページの管理を効率化し、正確な回答を生成するエージェントを可能にします。","ko":"코드베이스 파일을 읽고 베어러 인증과 같은 프로토콜 및 GET /api/faq와 같은 API를 사용하여 질문을 실제로 실행 가능한 범주로 분류하고 스팸을 식별하여 지원 페이지 관리를 간소화하고 정확한 답변을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes redactar respuestas precisas leyendo archivos de código base, clasificar preguntas en categorías accionables e identificar spam utilizando protocolos como Bearer auth y APIs como GET /api/faq, lo que simplifica la gestión de la página de soporte.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rédiger des réponses précises en lisant des fichiers de codebase, de classer les questions en catégories actionnables et d''identifier les spams en utilisant des protocoles tels que Bearer auth et des API comme GET /api/faq, ce qui simplifie la gestion de la page de support.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, genaue Antworten zu erstellen, indem sie Codebase-Dateien lesen, Fragen in handhabbare Kategorien einordnen und Spam mithilfe von Protokollen wie Bearer auth und APIs wie GET /api/faq erkennen, wodurch die Verwaltung der Support-Seite rationalisiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar respostas precisas lendo arquivos de código, classificar perguntas em categorias ação e identificar spam usando protocolos como Bearer auth e APIs como GET /api/faq, proporcionando assim uma gestão de página de suporte mais eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать точные ответы, читая файлы кода, классифицировать вопросы в категории действий и определять спам с помощью протоколов, таких как Bearer auth, и API, таких как GET /api/faq, тем самым оптимизируя управление страницей поддержки.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من صياغة إجابات دقيقة من خلال قراءة ملفات الشفرة وتصنيف الأسئلة إلى فئات إجراءات وتحديد البريد العشوائي باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل Bearer auth وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات مثل GET /api/faq، وبالتالي تسهيل إدارة صفحة الدعم"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating FAQ question processing","Generating accurate answers from codebase context","Flagging business questions for human review","Identifying spam for cleanup"],"zh":["自动化 FAQ 问题处理","从代码库上下文中生成准确的答案","标记商业问题以供人类审查","识别垃圾信息以进行清理"],"ja":["FAQ 質問の自動処理","コードベースのコンテキストから正確な回答を生成する","ビジネス質問を人間のレビューのためにフラグ付けする","スパムをクリーンアップするために識別する"],"ko":["FAQ 질문 자동 처리","코드베이스 컨텍스트에서 정확한 답변 생성","비즈니스 질문을 인간의 검토를 위해 플래그 지정","클린업을 위해 스팸 식별"],"es":["Automatización del procesamiento de preguntas de preguntas frecuentes","Generación de respuestas precisas desde el contexto de la base de código","Marcado de preguntas comerciales para revisión humana","Identificación de spam para limpieza"],"fr":["Automatisation du traitement des questions de questions fréquentes","Génération de réponses précises à partir du contexte de la base de code","Marquage des questions commerciales pour examen humain","Identification de spam pour nettoyage"],"de":["Automatisierung der Verarbeitung von FAQ-Fragen","Erstellung genauer Antworten aus dem Codebase-Kontext","Markierung von Geschäftsfragen für menschliche Überprüfung","Identifizierung von Spam zur Bereinigung"],"pt":["Automatizar o processamento de perguntas de FAQ","Gerar respostas precisas do contexto do código","Sinalizar perguntas comerciais para revisão humana","Identificar spam para limpeza"],"ru":["Автоматизация обработки вопросов FAQ","Генерация точных ответов из контекста кода","Помечание бизнес-вопросов для рассмотрения человеком","Определение спама для очистки"],"ar":["تأتمة معالجة أسئلة FAQ","генерация إجابات دقيقة من سياق الشفرة","تعليم الأسئلة التجارية لمراجعة الإنسان","تحديد البريد العشوائي للتنظيف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user approval for each action","Needs access to codebase files","Dependent on MatrixShader support page API"],"zh":["需要用户对每个操作进行批准","需要访问代码库文件","依赖于 MatrixShader 支持页面 API"],"ja":["各アクションに対するユーザーの承認が必要","コードベースファイルへのアクセスが必要","MatrixShader サポートページ API への依存"],"ko":["사용자 승인에 대한 모든 작업이 필요","코드베이스 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","매트릭스 셰이더 지원 페이지 API에 대한 의존"],"es":["Requiere aprobación del usuario para cada acción","Necesita acceso a archivos de código base","Dependiente de la API de página de soporte de MatrixShader"],"fr":["Nécessite l''approbation de l''utilisateur pour chaque action","A besoin d''accès à des fichiers de codebase","Dépend de l''API de page de support de MatrixShader"],"de":["Benutzerzustimmung für jede Aktion erforderlich","Benötigt Zugriff auf Codebase-Dateien","Abhängig von der Support-Seiten-API von MatrixShader"],"pt":["Requer aprovação do usuário para cada ação","Necessita acesso a arquivos de código","Dependente do suporte da API da página de suporte do MatrixShader"],"ru":["Требует одобрения пользователя для каждого действия","Требует доступа к файлам кода","Зависит от поддержки API страницы поддержки MatrixShader"],"ar":["يتطلب موافقة المستخدم على كل إجراء","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى ملفات الشفرة","يعتمد على دعم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات لصفحة الدعم MatrixShader"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a07ad33414c68316d7e0d24af3d3318ea17bec1dbf1ea1903f18f08b2b531018","qualityScore":42}');
