bles para la gestión de datos en aplicaciones React con TypeScript.","fr":"Koota est un système de gestion d''état qui utilise des entités avec des traits composables pour la gestion de données dans les applications React avec TypeScript.","de":"Koota ist ein Zustandsverwaltungssystem, das Entitäten mit komponierbaren Eigenschaften für die Datenverwaltung in React-Anwendungen mit TypeScript verwendet.","pt":"Koota é um sistema de gerenciamento de estado que utiliza entidades com traits para gerenciar dados em aplicações React","ru":"Koota - это система управления состоянием, использующая сущности с чертами для управления данными в приложениях React","ar":"كوتا هو نظام لتدبير الحالة يستخدم الكيانات مع السمات لتدبير البيانات في تطبيقات رياكت"},"features":{"en":["Manages state using entities with composable traits","Supports schema-based (SoA) and callback-based (AoS) trait definitions","Enables directional connections between entities via relations","Utilizes archetypes for unique combinations of traits","Provides a world context for all entities and their data"],"zh":["使用实体和特征进行状态管理","支持 React 和 TypeScript","高性能的实时状态管理","灵活的特性定义","支持图形构建"],"ja":["エンティティと特性を使用した状態管理","React と TypeScript のサポート","高パフォーマンスなリアルタイム状態管理","柔軟な特性定義","グラフ構築のサポート"],"ko":["엔티티와 특성을 사용하여 상태 관리","React 및 TypeScript 지원","고성능의 실시간 상태 관리","유연한 특성 정의","그래프 구축 지원"],"es":["Gestión de estado en tiempo real con entidades y rasgos componibles","Compatibilidad con React y TypeScript","Definición de datos mediante rasgos esquemáticos (SoA), basados en callbacks (AoS) o etiquetas","Conexiones direccionalmente entre entidades para construir gráficos","Contexto de mundo para todas las entidades y sus datos","Combinaciones únicas de rasgos que las entidades comparten (arquetipos)"],"fr":["Gestion d''état en temps réel avec des entités et des traits composables","Compatibilité avec React et TypeScript","Définition de données via des traits schématiques (SoA), basés sur des callbacks (AoS) ou des étiquettes","Connexions directionnelles entre entités pour construire des graphiques","Contexte de monde pour toutes les entités et leurs données","Combinaisons uniques de traits que les entités partagent (archétypes)"],"de":["Performante Echtzeit-Zustandsverwaltung mit Entitäten und komponierbaren Eigenschaften","Kompatibilität mit React und TypeScript","Datendefinition über Eigenschaften mit Schemata (SoA), Callbacks (AoS) oder Tags","Richtungsbeziehungen zwischen Entitäten zum Aufbau von Graphen","Kontext der Welt für alle Entitäten und ihre Daten","Einzigartige Kombinationen von Eigenschaften, die die Entitäten teilen (Archetypen)"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estado em tempo real com entidades e traits","Suporte a React e TypeScript","Utilização de arquétipos para combinação de traits","Criação de gráficos com relações direcionais entre entidades","Definição de dados com esquemas baseados em traits"],"ru":["Управление состоянием в реальном времени с помощью сущностей и черт","Поддержка React и TypeScript","Использование архетипов для комбинации черт","Создание графов с направленными связями между сущностями","Определение данных с помощью схем на основе черт"],"ar":["تدبير الحالة في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام الكيانات والسمات","دعم ریاکت و타입스크립트","استخدام النماذج للمزج بين السمات","إنشاء رسوم بيانية مع علاقات اتجاهية بين الكيانات","تعريف البيانات باستخدام مخططات قائمة على السمات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use koota","koota vs redux","koota install guide","what is koota","koota react integration","koota typescript support","koota state management","koota entity component system"],"zh":["Koota","实时状态管理","React","TypeScript","实体","特征","高性能","状态管理解决方案"],"ja":["Koota","リアルタイム状態管理","React","TypeScript","エンティティ","特性","高パフォーマンス","状態管理ソリューション"],"ko":["Koota","실시간 상태 관리","React","TypeScript","엔티티","특성","고성능","상태 관리 솔루션"],"es":["Koota","gestión de estado en tiempo real","React","TypeScript","entidades con rasgos componibles","SoA","AoS","etiquetas","gráficos","arquetipos"],"fr":["Koota","gestion d''état en temps réel","React","TypeScript","entités avec des traits composables","SoA","AoS","étiquettes","graphiques","archétypes"],"de":["Koota","performante Echtzeit-Zustandsverwaltung","React","TypeScript","Entitäten mit komponierbaren Eigenschaften","SoA","AoS","Tags","Graphen","Archetypen"],"pt":["koota","gerenciamento de estado","react","typescript","entidades","traits","arquétipos","gráficos","esquemas de dados"],"ru":["koota","управление состоянием","react","typescript","сущности","черты","архетипы","графы","схемы данных"],"ar":["كوتا","تدبير الحالة","رياكت","타입스크립트","الكيانات","السمات","النماذج","الرسوم البيانية","مخططات البيانات"]}},"owner":"pmndrs","repo":"koota","repoPath":"pmndrs/koota","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.274Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"koota","description":"Real-time ECS state management for TypeScript and React. Use when the user mentions koota, ECS, entities, traits, queries, or building data-oriented applications.","bodyPreview":"# Koota ECS\n\nKoota manages state using entities with composable traits.\n\n## Glossary\n\n- **Entity** - A unique identifier pointing to data defined by traits. Spawned from a world.\n- **Trait** - A reusable data definition. Can be schema-based (SoA), callback-based (AoS), or a tag.\n- **Relation** - A directional connection between entities to build graphs.\n- **World** - The context for all entities and their data (traits).\n- **Archetype** - A unique combination of traits that entities share.\n- **Qu","body":"# Koota ECS\n\nKoota manages state using entities with composable traits.\n\n## Glossary\n\n- **Entity** - A unique identifier pointing to data defined by traits. Spawned from a world.\n- **Trait** - A reusable data definition. Can be schema-based (SoA), callback-based (AoS), or a tag.\n- **Relation** - A directional connection between entities to build graphs.\n- **World** - The context for all entities and their data (traits).\n- **Archetype** - A unique combination of traits that entities share.\n- **Query** - Fetches entities matching an archetype. The primary way to batch update state.\n- **Action** - A discrete, synchronous data mutation (create, update, destroy). Reusable from any call site.\n- **System** - A reactive orchestrator that observes state changes and coordinates work, including async workflows. Runs in the frame loop or event callbacks.\n\n## Design Principles\n\n### Data-oriented\n\nBehavior is separated from data. Data is defined as traits, entities compose traits, and systems mutate data on traits via queries. See [Basic usage](#basic-usage) for a complete example.\n\n### Composable systems\n\nDesign systems as small, single-purpose units rather than monolithic functions that do everything in sequence. Each system should handle one concern so that behaviors can be toggled on/off independently.\n\n```typescript\n// Good: Composable systems - each can be enabled/disabled independently\nfunction applyVelocity(world: World) {}\nfunction applyGravity(world: World) {}\nfunction applyFriction(world: World) {}\nfunction syncToDOM(world: World) {}\n\n// Bad: Monolithic system - can''t disable gravity without disabling everything\nfunction updatePhysicsAndRender(world: World) {\n  // velocity, gravity, friction, DOM sync all in one function\n}\n```\n\nThis enables feature flags, debugging (disable one system to isolate issues), and flexible runtime configurations.\n\n### Decouple view from logic\n\nSeparate core state and logic (the \"core\") from the view (\"app\"):\n\n- Run logic independent of rendering\n- Swap views while keeping state (2D ↔ 3D)\n- Run logic in a worker or on a server\n\n### Prefer traits + actions over classes\n\nPrefer not to use classes to encapsulate data and behavior. Use traits for data and actions for behavior. Only use classes when required by external libraries (e.g., THREE.js objects) or the user prefers it.\n\n## Directory structure\n\nIf the user has a preferred structure, follow it. Otherwise, use this guidance: the directory structure should mirror how the app''s data model is organized. Separate core state/logic from the view layer:\n\n- **Core** - Pure TypeScript. Traits, systems, actions, world. No view imports.\n- **View** - Reads from world, mutates via actions. Organized by domain/feature.\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── core/              # Pure TypeScript, no view imports\n│   ├── traits/\n│   ├── systems/\n│   ├── actions/\n│   └── world.ts\n└── features/          # View layer, organized by domain\n```\n\nFiles are organized by role, not by feature slice. Traits and systems are composable and don''t map cleanly to features.\n\nFor detailed patterns and monorepo structures, see [references/architecture.md](references/architecture.md).\n\n## Trait types\n\n| Type               | Syntax                     | Use when                  | Examples                         |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------- | ------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **SoA (Schema)**   | `trait({ x: 0 })`          | Simple primitive data     | `Position`, `Velocity`, `Health` |\n| **AoS (Callback)** | `trait(() => new Thing())` | Complex objects/instances | `Ref` (DOM), `Keyboard` (Set)    |\n| **Tag**            | `trait()`                  | No data, just a flag      | `IsPlayer`, `IsEnemy`, `IsDead`  |\n\n## Trait naming conventions\n\n| Type          | Pattern         | Examples                         |\n| ------------- | --------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Tags**      | Start with `Is` | `IsPlayer`, `IsEnemy`, `IsDead`  |\n| **Relations** | Prepositional   | `ChildOf`, `HeldBy`, `Contains`  |\n| **Trait**     | Noun            | `Position`, `Velocity`, `Health` |\n\n## Relations\n\nRelations build graphs between entities such as hierarchies, inventories, targeting.\n\n```typescript\nimport { relation } from ''koota''\n\nconst ChildOf = relation({ autoDestroy: ''orphan'' }) // Hierarchy\nconst Contains = relation({ store: { amount: 0 } }) // With data\nconst Targeting = relation({ exclusive: true }) // One target only\n\n// Build graph\nconst parent = world.spawn()\nconst child = world.spawn(ChildOf(parent))\n\n// Query children of parent\nconst children = world.query(ChildOf(parent))\n\n// Query all entities with any ChildOf relation\nconst allChildren = world.query(ChildOf(''*''))\n\n// Get targets from entity\nconst items = entity.targetsFor(Contains) // Entity[]\nconst target = entity.targetFor(Targeting) // Entity | undefined\n```\n\nFor detailed patterns, traversal, ordered relations, and anti-patterns, see [references/relations.md](references/relations.md).\n\n## Basic usage\n\n```typescript\nimport { trait, createWorld } from ''koota''\n\n// 1. Define traits\nconst Position = trait({ x: 0, y: 0 })\nconst Velocity = trait({ x: 0, y: 0 })\nconst IsPlayer = trait()\n\n// 2. Create world and spawn entities\nconst world = createWorld()\nconst player = world.spawn(Position({ x: 100, y: 50 }), Velocity, IsPlayer)\n\n// 3. Query and update\nworld.query(Position, Velocity).updateEach(([pos, vel]) => {\n  pos.x += vel.x\n  pos.y += vel.y\n})\n```\n\n## Entities\n\nEntities are unique identifiers that compose traits. Spawned from a world.\n\n```typescript\n// Spawn\nconst entity = world.spawn(Position, Velocity)\n\n// Read/write traits\nentity.get(Position) // Read trait data\nentity.set(Position, { x: 10 }) // Write (triggers change events)\nentity.add(IsPlayer) // Add trait\nentity.remove(Velocity) // Remove trait\nentity.has(Position) // Check if has trait\n\n// Destroy\nentity.destroy()\n```\n\n**Entity IDs**\n\nAn entity is internally a number packed with entity ID, generation ID (for recycling), and world ID. Safe to store directly for persistence or networking.\n\n```typescript\nentity.id() // Just the entity ID (reused after destroy)\nentity // Full packed number (unique forever)\n```\n\n**Typing**\n\nUse `TraitRecord` to get the type that `entity.get()` returns\n\n```typescript\ntype PositionRecord = TraitRecord<typeof Position>\n```\n\n## Queries\n\nQueries fetch entities matching an archetype and are the primary way to batch update state.\n\n```typescript\n// Query and update\nworld.query(Position, Velocity).updateEach(([pos, vel]) => {\n  pos.x += vel.x\n  pos.y += vel.y\n})\n\n// Read-only iteration (no write-back)\nconst data: Array<{ x: number; y: number }> = []\nworld.query(Position, Velocity).readEach(([pos, vel]) => {\n  data.push({ x: pos.x, y: pos.y })\n})\n\n// Get first match\nconst player = world.queryFirst(IsPlayer, Position)\n\n// Filter with modifiers\nworld.query(Position, Not(Velocity)) // Has Position but not Velocity\nworld.query(Or(IsPlayer, IsEnemy)) // Has either trait\n```\n\n**Note:** `updateEach`/`readEach` only return data-bearing traits (SoA/AoS). Tags, `Not()`, and relation filters are **excluded**:\n\n```typescript\nworld.query(IsPlayer, Position, Velocity).updateEach(([pos, vel]) => {\n  // Array has 2 elements - IsPlayer (tag) excluded\n})\n```\n\nFor tracking changes, caching queries, and advanced patterns, see [references/queries.md](references/queries.md).\n\n## React integration\n\n**Imports:** Core types (`World`, `Entity`) from `''koota''`. React hooks from `''koota/react''`.\n\n**Change detection:** `entity.set()` and `world.set()` trigger change events that cause hooks like `useTrait` to rerender. For AoS traits where you mutate objects directly, manually signal with `entity.changed(Trait)`.\n\nFor React hooks and actions, see [references/react-hooks.md](references/react-hooks.md).\n\nFor component patterns (App, Startup, Renderer, view sync, input), see [references/react-patterns.md](references/react-patterns.md).\n\n## Runtime\n\nSystems query the world and update entities. Run them via frameloop (continuous) or event handlers (discrete).\n\nFor systems, frameloop, event-driven patterns, and time management, see [references/runtime.md](references/runtime.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:35.529Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for React and TypeScript Agents seeking optimized state management with composable traits and entity-based data handling.","zh":"适用于 React 和 TypeScript Agent，能够优化状态管理，具有可组合的特征和基于实体的数据处理。","ja":"React と TypeScript Agent に最適で、状態管理の最適化と、組み合わせ可能な特性およびエンティティベースのデータ処理を実現します。","ko":"React 및 TypeScript 에이전트에 적합하며 상태 관리를 최적화하고 구성 가능한 특성 및 엔티티 기반 데이터 처리를 제공합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de React y TypeScript que buscan una gestión de estado optimizada con rasgos componibles y manejo de datos basado en entidades.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents React et TypeScript recherchant une gestion d''état optimisée avec des traits composables et une gestion des données basée sur les entités.","de":"Ideal für React- und TypeScript-Agents, die eine optimierte Zustandsverwaltung mit komponierbaren Traits und einer entitätsbasierten Datenhandhabung suchen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes React e TypeScript que buscam gerenciamento de estado otimizado com traços compostos e manipulação de dados baseada em entidades.","ru":"Идеально для агентов React и TypeScript, ищущих оптимизированное управление состоянием с составными чертами и обработкой данных на основе сущностей.","ar":"مثاليสำหรعوامل React وTypeScript الذين يبحثون عن إدارة حالة محسنة مع سمات قابلة للتكوين ومعالجة البيانات القائمة على الكيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage state using entities with composable traits, supporting schema-based, callback-based, and tag-based data definitions with Relations and Archetypes, leveraging the Koota ECS for real-time state updates.","zh":"赋予 Agent 使用实体和可组合特性高效管理状态的能力，支持基于模式、回调和标签的数据定义，具有关系和原型，利用 Koota ECS 实现实时状态更新。","ja":"エージェントがエンティティと組み合わせ可能な特性を使用して状態を効率的に管理できるようにし、スキーマベース、コールバックベース、タグベースのデータ定義をサポートし、関係と原型を利用して、Koota ECS を使用したリアルタイム状態更新を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 엔티티와 구성 가능한 특성을 사용하여 상태를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 하는데, 이는 스키마 기반, 콜백 기반 및 태그 기반 데이터 정의를 지원하며 관계 및 원형을 사용하여 Koota ECS를 통해 실시간 상태 업데이트를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar el estado de manera eficiente utilizando entidades con rasgos componibles, admitiendo definiciones de datos basadas en esquemas, callbacks y etiquetas con Relations y Archetypes, aprovechando el Koota ECS para actualizaciones de estado en tiempo real.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement l''état en utilisant des entités avec des traits composables, prenant en charge les définitions de données basées sur des schémas, des callbacks et des étiquettes avec Relations et Archetypes, tirant parti du Koota ECS pour les mises à jour d''état en temps réel.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents, Zustände effizient mit Entitäten und komponierbaren Traits zu verwalten, unterstützt schemabasierte, callback-basierte und tag-basierte Datendefinitionen mit Relations und Archetypes und nutzt das Koota ECS für Echtzeit-Zustandsaktualisierungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar eficientemente o estado usando entidades com traços compostos, suportando definições de dados baseadas em esquema, baseadas em callback e baseadas em tag com Relações e Arquétipos, aproveitando o Koota ECS para atualizações de estado em tempo real.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять состоянием с помощью сущностей, обладающих составными чертами, поддерживая определения данных на основе схемы, callback и тегов с Отношениями и Архетипами, используя Koota ECS для обновлений состояния в реальном времени.","ar":"تمكّن العوامل من إدارة الحالة بفعالية باستخدام الكيانات ذات السمات القابلة للتكوين، مع دعم تعريفات البيانات القائمة على المخطط والاستدعاء والتعريفات القائمة على العلامات مع العلاقات والأصنام، واستخدام Koota ECS للحصول على تحديثات الحالة في الوقت الفعلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Managing complex application states with composable traits","Building entity-based data models with Relations and Archetypes","Optimizing real-time state updates in React applications"],"zh":["使用可组合特性管理复杂的应用程序状态","使用关系和原型构建基于实体的数据模型","在 React 应用程序中优化实时状态更新"],"ja":["組み合わせ可能な特性を使用して複雑なアプリケーション状態を管理する","関係と原型を使用してエンティティベースのデータモデルを構築する","React アプリケーションでのリアルタイム状態更新の最適化"],"ko":["구성 가능한 특성을 사용하여 복잡한 애플리케이션 상태를 관리하는 것","관계 및 원형을 사용하여 엔티티 기반 데이터 모델을 구축하는 것","React 애플리케이션에서 실시간 상태 업데이트를 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Gestionar estados de aplicación complejos con rasgos componibles","Construir modelos de datos basados en entidades con Relations y Archetypes","Optimizar actualizaciones de estado en tiempo real en aplicaciones React"],"fr":["Gérer des états d''application complexes avec des traits composables","Construire des modèles de données basés sur des entités avec Relations et Archetypes","Optimiser les mises à jour d''état en temps réel dans les applications React"],"de":["Verwalten komplexer Anwendungszustände mit komponierbaren Traits","Erstellen entitätsbasierter Datenmodelle mit Relations und Archetypes","Optimieren von Echtzeit-Zustandsaktualisierungen in React-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estados de aplicação complexos com traços compostos","Construção de modelos de dados baseados em entidades com Relações e Arquétipos","Otimização de atualizações de estado em tempo real em aplicações React"],"ru":["Управление сложными состояниями приложений с составными чертами","Построение моделей данных на основе сущностей с Отношениями и Архетипами","Оптимизация обновлений состояния в реальном времени в приложениях React"],"ar":["إدارة حالات التطبيق المعقدة مع السمات القابلة للتكوين","بناء نماذج البيانات القائمة على الكيانات مع العلاقات والأصنام","تحسين تحديثات الحالة في الوقت الفعلي في تطبيقات React"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React and TypeScript environments","Limited to entity-based state management"],"zh":["需要 React 和 TypeScript 环境","仅限于基于实体的状态管理"],"ja":["React と TypeScript 環境が必要","エンティティベースの状態管理に限定される"],"ko":["React 및 TypeScript 환경이 필요함","엔티티 기반 상태 관리로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere entornos de React y TypeScript","Limitado a la gestión de estado basada en entidades"],"fr":["Nécessite des environnements React et TypeScript","Limité à la gestion d''état basée sur les entités"],"de":["Erfordert React- und TypeScript-Umgebungen","Beschränkt auf die entitätsbasierte Zustandsverwaltung"],"pt":["Requer ambientes React e TypeScript","Limitado a gerenciamento de estado baseado em entidades"],"ru":["Требует среды React и TypeScript","Ограничен управлением состоянием на основе сущностей"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئات React وTypeScript","محدود بإدارة الحالة القائمة على الكيانات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7d75390892021b7230b21fd3e34342996508fa1b2346bcab2a583de187a2ef09","qualityScore":42}');
