ne-Spiele","Bibliotheksverwaltung von Spielen"],"pt":["GOG","OpenClaw","clone python","gerenciamento de bibliotecas de jogos","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","bash","read_file","write_file","web_fetch","web_search"],"ru":["GOG","OpenClaw","клон на Python","управление библиотеками игр","инструменты разработки","bash","read_file","write_file","web_fetch","web_search","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["GOG","OpenClaw","نسخة بايثون","ادارة مكتبات الألعاب","أدوات التطوير","bash","read_file","write_file","web_fetch","web_search","العميل الذكي"]}},"owner":"openjavis","repo":"openclaw-python","repoPath":"openjavis/openclaw-python","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.271Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gog","description":"Google Workspace CLI for Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets, and Docs.","bodyPreview":"# gog\n\nUse `gog` for Gmail/Calendar/Drive/Contacts/Sheets/Docs. Requires OAuth setup.\n\nSetup (once)\n\n- `gog auth credentials /path/to/client_secret.json`\n- `gog auth add you@gmail.com --services gmail,calendar,drive,contacts,docs,sheets`\n- `gog auth list`\n\nCommon commands\n\n- Gmail search: `gog gmail search ''newer_than:7d'' --max 10`\n- Gmail messages search (per email, ignores threading): `gog gmail messages search \"in:inbox from:ryanair.com\" --max 20 --account you@example.com`\n- Gmail send (plain","body":"# gog\n\nUse `gog` for Gmail/Calendar/Drive/Contacts/Sheets/Docs. Requires OAuth setup.\n\nSetup (once)\n\n- `gog auth credentials /path/to/client_secret.json`\n- `gog auth add you@gmail.com --services gmail,calendar,drive,contacts,docs,sheets`\n- `gog auth list`\n\nCommon commands\n\n- Gmail search: `gog gmail search ''newer_than:7d'' --max 10`\n- Gmail messages search (per email, ignores threading): `gog gmail messages search \"in:inbox from:ryanair.com\" --max 20 --account you@example.com`\n- Gmail send (plain): `gog gmail send --to a@b.com --subject \"Hi\" --body \"Hello\"`\n- Gmail send (multi-line): `gog gmail send --to a@b.com --subject \"Hi\" --body-file ./message.txt`\n- Gmail send (stdin): `gog gmail send --to a@b.com --subject \"Hi\" --body-file -`\n- Gmail send (HTML): `gog gmail send --to a@b.com --subject \"Hi\" --body-html \"<p>Hello</p>\"`\n- Gmail draft: `gog gmail drafts create --to a@b.com --subject \"Hi\" --body-file ./message.txt`\n- Gmail send draft: `gog gmail drafts send <draftId>`\n- Gmail reply: `gog gmail send --to a@b.com --subject \"Re: Hi\" --body \"Reply\" --reply-to-message-id <msgId>`\n- Calendar list events: `gog calendar events <calendarId> --from <iso> --to <iso>`\n- Calendar create event: `gog calendar create <calendarId> --summary \"Title\" --from <iso> --to <iso>`\n- Calendar create with color: `gog calendar create <calendarId> --summary \"Title\" --from <iso> --to <iso> --event-color 7`\n- Calendar update event: `gog calendar update <calendarId> <eventId> --summary \"New Title\" --event-color 4`\n- Calendar show colors: `gog calendar colors`\n- Drive search: `gog drive search \"query\" --max 10`\n- Contacts: `gog contacts list --max 20`\n- Sheets get: `gog sheets get <sheetId> \"Tab!A1:D10\" --json`\n- Sheets update: `gog sheets update <sheetId> \"Tab!A1:B2\" --values-json ''[[\"A\",\"B\"],[\"1\",\"2\"]]'' --input USER_ENTERED`\n- Sheets append: `gog sheets append <sheetId> \"Tab!A:C\" --values-json ''[[\"x\",\"y\",\"z\"]]'' --insert INSERT_ROWS`\n- Sheets clear: `gog sheets clear <sheetId> \"Tab!A2:Z\"`\n- Sheets metadata: `gog sheets metadata <sheetId> --json`\n- Docs export: `gog docs export <docId> --format txt --out /tmp/doc.txt`\n- Docs cat: `gog docs cat <docId>`\n\nCalendar Colors\n\n- Use `gog calendar colors` to see all available event colors (IDs 1-11)\n- Add colors to events with `--event-color <id>` flag\n- Event color IDs (from `gog calendar colors` output):\n  - 1: #a4bdfc\n  - 2: #7ae7bf\n  - 3: #dbadff\n  - 4: #ff887c\n  - 5: #fbd75b\n  - 6: #ffb878\n  - 7: #46d6db\n  - 8: #e1e1e1\n  - 9: #5484ed\n  - 10: #51b749\n  - 11: #dc2127\n\nEmail Formatting\n\n- Prefer plain text. Use `--body-file` for multi-paragraph messages (or `--body-file -` for stdin).\n- Same `--body-file` pattern works for drafts and replies.\n- `--body` does not unescape `\\n`. If you need inline newlines, use a heredoc or `$''Line 1\\n\\nLine 2''`.\n- Use `--body-html` only when you need rich formatting.\n- HTML tags: `<p>` for paragraphs, `<br>` for line breaks, `<strong>` for bold, `<em>` for italic, `<a href=\"url\">` for links, `<ul>`/`<li>` for lists.\n- Example (plain text via stdin):\n\n  ```bash\n  gog gmail send --to recipient@example.com \\\n    --subject \"Meeting Follow-up\" \\\n    --body-file - <<''EOF''\n  Hi Name,\n\n  Thanks for meeting today. Next steps:\n  - Item one\n  - Item two\n\n  Best regards,\n  Your Name\n  EOF\n  ```\n\n- Example (HTML list):\n  ```bash\n  gog gmail send --to recipient@example.com \\\n    --subject \"Meeting Follow-up\" \\\n    --body-html \"<p>Hi Name,</p><p>Thanks for meeting today. Here are the next steps:</p><ul><li>Item one</li><li>Item two</li></ul><p>Best regards,<br>Your Name</p>\"\n  ```\n\nNotes\n\n- Set `GOG_ACCOUNT=you@gmail.com` to avoid repeating `--account`.\n- For scripting, prefer `--json` plus `--no-input`.\n- Sheets values can be passed via `--values-json` (recommended) or as inline rows.\n- Docs supports export/cat/copy. In-place edits require a Docs API client (not in gog).\n- Confirm before sending mail or creating events.\n- `gog gmail search` returns one row per thread; use `gog gmail messages search` when you need every individual email returned separately.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:45.854Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Integration Agents needing unified access to Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets, and Docs via OAuth.","zh":"非常适合需要统一访问Gmail、Calendar、Drive、Contacts、Sheets和Docs的Cloud Integration Agents，通过OAuth实现统一访问。","ja":"Gmail、Calendar、Drive、Contacts、Sheets、Docsへの統一されたアクセスが必要なCloud Integration Agentsに最適。OAuthを介してアクセスできます。","ko":"Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets, Docs에 대한統一된 액세스가 필요한 Cloud Integration 에이전트에게 적합합니다. OAuth를 통해 액세스할 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de integración en la nube que necesitan acceso unificado a Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets y Docs a través de OAuth.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intégration cloud nécessitant un accès unifié à Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets et Docs via OAuth.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Integration-Agenten, die einen einheitlichen Zugriff auf Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets und Docs über OAuth benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Integração em Nuvem que necessitam de acesso unificado ao Gmail, Calendário, Drive, Contatos, Planilhas e Docs via OAuth.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов облачной интеграции, которым требуется унифицированный доступ к Gmail, Календарю, Диску, Контактам, Таблицам и Документам через OAuth.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل التكامل السحابي التي تحتاج إلى وصول موحد إلى Gmail و التقويم و Drive و جهات الاتصال و الأوراق و المستندات عبر OAuth."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch web content and execute commands across Google services using OAuth setup, enabling seamless interactions with Gmail, Calendar, and Drive through standardized tools and protocols like JSON and HTTP requests.","zh":"赋予代理程序通过OAuth设置获取网页内容和执行命令的能力，实现与Gmail、Calendar和Drive的无缝交互，使用标准化工具和协议如JSON和HTTP请求。","ja":"OAuth設定を使用して、エージェントがWebコンテンツを取得し、コマンドを実行できるようにし、Gmail、Calendar、Driveとのシームレスなやり取りを可能にします。標準化されたツールとプロトコル（JSON、HTTPリクエストなど）を使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 OAuth 설정을 통해 웹 콘텐츠를 가져오고 명령을 실행할 수 있도록 하여 Gmail, Calendar 및 Drive와의 무결점 상호 작용을 가능하게 합니다. 표준화된 도구 및 프로토콜(JSON, HTTP 요청 등)을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recuperar contenido web y ejecutar comandos en los servicios de Google mediante la configuración de OAuth, lo que permite interacciones sin problemas con Gmail, Calendar y Drive a través de herramientas y protocolos estandarizados como JSON y solicitudes HTTP.","fr":"Permet aux agents de récupérer le contenu web et d''exécuter des commandes sur les services Google à l''aide de la configuration OAuth, ce qui permet des interactions sans problème avec Gmail, Calendar et Drive via des outils et des protocoles standardisés comme JSON et les requêtes HTTP.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Webinhalte abzurufen und Befehle über Google-Dienste mithilfe der OAuth-Konfiguration auszuführen, wodurch ein nahtloser Austausch mit Gmail, Calendar und Drive über standardisierte Tools und Protokolle wie JSON und HTTP-Anfragen ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar conteúdo da web e executar comandos em serviços do Google usando a configuração OAuth, permitindo interações sem problemas com o Gmail, Calendário e Drive por meio de ferramentas e protocolos padronizados como JSON e solicitações HTTP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать веб-контент и выполнять команды во всех сервисах Google с помощью настройки OAuth, обеспечивая бесшовное взаимодействие с Gmail, Календарем и Диском через стандартизированные инструменты и протоколы, такие как JSON и HTTP-запросы.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من استخراج المحتوى الويب وتشغيل الأوامر عبر خدمات جوجل باستخدام إعداد OAuth، مما يتيح التفاعلات السلسة مع Gmail و التقويم و Drive من خلال أدوات وبروتوكولات موحدة مثل JSON وطلبات HTTP."},"useCases":{"en":["Searching Gmail messages with specific filters","Sending plain text emails via Gmail","Managing Google Calendar events and contacts"],"zh":["使用特定过滤器搜索Gmail消息","通过Gmail发送纯文本电子邮件","管理Google Calendar事件和联系人"],"ja":["特定のフィルタを使用してGmailメッセージを検索する","Gmailを介してプレーンテキストの電子メールを送信する","Google Calendarのイベントと連絡先を管理する"],"ko":["특정 필터를 사용하여 Gmail 메시지를 검색하는 것","Gmail을 통해 평문 전자 메일을 보내는 것","Google Calendar의 이벤트와 연락처를 관리하는 것"],"es":["Buscar mensajes de Gmail con filtros específicos","Enviar correos electrónicos de texto plano a través de Gmail","Administrar eventos y contactos de Google Calendar"],"fr":["Rechercher des messages Gmail avec des filtres spécifiques","Envoyer des e-mails de texte brut via Gmail","Gérer les événements et les contacts de Google Calendar"],"de":["Suchen von Gmail-Nachrichten mit bestimmten Filtern","Senden von Plain-Text-E-Mails über Gmail","Verwalten von Google-Kalender-Ereignissen und -Kontakten"],"pt":["Pesquisar mensagens do Gmail com filtros específicos","Enviar e-mails de texto simples via Gmail","Gerenciar eventos e contatos do Google Calendar"],"ru":["Поиск сообщений Gmail с конкретными фильтрами","Отправка простых текстовых писем через Gmail","Управление событиями и контактами Google Календаря"],"ar":["البحث عن رسائل Gmail بفلاتر محددة","إرسال رسائل بريد إلكتروني نصية بسيطة عبر Gmail","إدارة أحداث و جهات اتصال التقويم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OAuth setup with client_secret.json","Limited to Google services","Needs specific account authentication for each service"],"zh":["需要使用client_secret.json设置OAuth","仅限Google服务","需要为每个服务进行特定帐户身份验证"],"ja":["client_secret.jsonを使用してOAuthを設定する必要がある","Googleサービスのみ","各サービスに対して特定のアカウント認証が必要"],"ko":["client_secret.json을 사용하여 OAuth를 설정해야 함","Google 서비스만 해당","각 서비스에 대해 특정 계정 인증이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de OAuth con client_secret.json","Limitado a los servicios de Google","Necesita autenticación de cuenta específica para cada servicio"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration OAuth avec client_secret.json","Limité aux services Google","Nécessite une authentification de compte spécifique pour chaque service"],"de":["Benötigt OAuth-Konfiguration mit client_secret.json","Begrenzt auf Google-Dienste","Benötigt spezifische Kontenauthentifizierung für jeden Dienst"],"pt":["Requer configuração OAuth com client_secret.json","Limitado a serviços do Google","Necessita de autenticação de conta específica para cada serviço"],"ru":["Требует настройки OAuth с client_secret.json","Ограничен сервисами Google","Требует специфической аутентификации учетной записи для каждого сервиса"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد OAuth مع client_secret.json","محدود لخدمات جوجل","يحتاج إلى مصادقة حساب محددة لكل خدمة"]}